









<h4 tabindex="-1">
   <span>Ditz iſt ein mere rich</span><span class="lb">|</span><span>von dem armen Heinrich</span>
   </h4>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1" id="v_1" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1">v_1
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>E</span>in ritter ſo geleret was,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_2" id="v_2" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_2">v_2
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_2
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er an den bvchen las,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_3" id="v_3" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_3">v_3
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_3
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz er dar an geſchriben vant.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_4" id="v_4" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_4">v_4
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_4
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der was hartman genant
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_5" id="v_5" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_5">v_5
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_5
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde was ein dienſtman von owe.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_6" id="v_6" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_6">v_6
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_6
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der nam im eine ſchowe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_7" id="v_7" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_7">v_7
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_7
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an einem itſlichen bvchen;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_8" id="v_8" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_8">v_8
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_8
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar an begonde er ſvchen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_9" id="v_9" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_9">v_9
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_9
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ob er iht des fvnde,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_10" id="v_10" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_10">v_10
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_10
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do mit er ſwere ſtvnde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_11" id="v_11" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_11">v_11
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_11
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Senfter mohte machen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_12" id="v_12" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_12">v_12
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_12
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit ſo geweren ſachen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_13" id="v_13" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_13">v_13
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_13
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz zv gotes eren tochte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_14" id="v_14" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_14">v_14
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_14
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do mit er ſich mohte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_15" id="v_15" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_15">v_15
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_15
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ge lieben den levten.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_16" id="v_16" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_16">v_16
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_16
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hie beginnet er unſ devten;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_17" id="v_17" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_17">v_17
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_17
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ein rede er hie geſchriben vant.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_18" id="v_18" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_18">v_18
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_18
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar vmbe hat er ſich genant,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_19" id="v_19" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_19">v_19
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_19
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er ſiner arbeit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_20" id="v_20" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_20">v_20
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_20
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die er an ditz bvch hat geleit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_21" id="v_21" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_21">v_21
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_21
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ane lon icht belibe;
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_22" id="v_22" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_22">v_22
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_22
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſwer is nach ſinem libe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_23" id="v_23" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_23">v_23
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_23
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Hore ſagen oder leſe,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_24" id="v_24" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_24">v_24
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_24
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er bitende weſe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_25" id="v_25" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_25">v_25
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_25
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der ſele heiles hin ze gote.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_26" id="v_26" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_26">v_26
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_26
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er giht, er ſi ſin ſelbes bote
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_27" id="v_27" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_27">v_27
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_27
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Vnde loſe ſich ſelber da mite,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_28" id="v_28" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_28">v_28
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_28
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſwer vor des andern ſvnde bite.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_29" id="v_29" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_29">v_29
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_29
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>E</span>R las vnſ ditz mere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_30" id="v_30" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_30">v_30
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_30
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie daz ein herre were
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_31" id="v_31" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_31">v_31
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_31
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv ſwaben geſezzen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_32" id="v_32" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_32">v_32
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_32
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an dem was niht vergezzen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_33" id="v_33" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_33">v_33
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_33
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   aller der tvgent,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_34" id="v_34" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_34">v_34
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_34
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der ein ritter in ſiner Jvgent
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_35" id="v_35" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_35">v_35
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_35
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ze gantzem lobe haben ſol.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_36" id="v_36" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_36">v_36
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_36
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Man ſprach nieman alſo wol
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_37" id="v_37" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_37">v_37
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_37
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn allen den richen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_38" id="v_38" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_38">v_38
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_38
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er hatte werlichen
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_39" id="v_39" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_39">v_39
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_39
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gebvrt vnde wiſheit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_40" id="v_40" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_40">v_40
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_40
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sin tvgent, die was vil breit;
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_41" id="v_41" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_41">v_41
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_41
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swie gantz ſin habe were,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_42" id="v_42" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_42">v_42
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_42
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo was ſin bvrt vnwandelbere,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_43" id="v_43" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_43">v_43
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_43
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Andern fvrſten gelich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_44" id="v_44" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_44">v_44
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_44
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was vnnahe alſo rich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_45" id="v_45" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_45">v_45
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_45
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der gebvrt vnd des gvtes
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_46" id="v_46" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_46">v_46
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_46
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als der eren vnd des mvtes.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_47" id="v_47" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_47">v_47
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_47
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sin nam, der was erkennelich:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_48" id="v_48" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_48">v_48
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_48
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was geheizen heinrich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_49" id="v_49" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_49">v_49
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_49
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde was von owe geborn.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_50" id="v_50" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_50">v_50
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_50
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſin herze, daz hatte im verſworn
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_51" id="v_51" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_51">v_51
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_51
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   valſch<span class="del">e</span>valſchevalſch vnde alle dorpheit.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_52" id="v_52" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_52">v_52
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_52
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vil wol behielt er den eit
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_53" id="v_53" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_53">v_53
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_53
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Stet biz an ſin ende;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_54" id="v_54" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_54">v_54
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_54
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an alle miſſewende
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_55" id="v_55" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_55">v_55
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_55
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Stvnt ſin gebvrt vnd ſin leben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_56" id="v_56" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_56">v_56
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_56
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jm was der rechter wunſch gegeben.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_57" id="v_57" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_57">v_57
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_57
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die werltlichen eren
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_58" id="v_58" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_58">v_58
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_58
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   konde er wol gemeren
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_59" id="v_59" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_59">v_59
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_59
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit mancher hande tvgent.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_60" id="v_60" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_60">v_60
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_60
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was ein blvme der Jvgent,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_61" id="v_61" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_61">v_61
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_61
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der werlde vrevde ein ſpigel glas,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_62" id="v_62" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_62">v_62
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_62
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſteter treͮwe ein adamas.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_63" id="v_63" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_63">v_63
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_63
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_64" id="v_64" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_64">v_64
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_64
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_64a" id="v_64a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_64a">v_64a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_64a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er was milde des gvtes,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_64b" id="v_64b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_64b">v_64b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_64b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ein lewe ſines mvtes,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_65" id="v_65" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_65">v_65
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_65
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ein ſchilt ſiner mage,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_66" id="v_66" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_66">v_66
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_66
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der milde ein geliche wage,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_67" id="v_67" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_67">v_67
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_67
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jm wart vber noch gebraſt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_68" id="v_68" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_68">v_68
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_68
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er trvk die arbeit als ein laſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_69" id="v_69" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_69">v_69
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_69
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die ere vber rvcke,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_70" id="v_70" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_70">v_70
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_70
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was des rates brvcke
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_71" id="v_71" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_71">v_71
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_71
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ſanc ſo wol von minnen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_72" id="v_72" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_72">v_72
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_72
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſuſt konde er gewinnen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_73" id="v_73" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_73">v_73
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_73
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der werlde lob vnd iren pris,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_74" id="v_74" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_74">v_74
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_74
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was ſchone, Jvnch, / hvbſch vn̄ wis.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_75" id="v_75" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_75">v_75
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_75
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>O der herre heinrich
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_76" id="v_76" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_76">v_76
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_76
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſuſt geniete ſich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_77" id="v_77" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_77">v_77
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_77
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Eren vnde gvtes
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_78" id="v_78" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_78">v_78
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_78
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde vroliches mvtes
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_78a" id="v_78a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_78a">v_78a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_78a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ in der werlde lebete,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_78b" id="v_78b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_78b">v_78b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_78b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn dirre ſvͤzze ſwebete,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_79" id="v_79" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_79">v_79
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_79
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn der werltlicher wunne,
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_80" id="v_80" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_80">v_80
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_80
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was vber alles ſin kvnne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_81" id="v_81" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_81">v_81
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_81
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ge hohet vnde ge eret.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_82" id="v_82" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_82">v_82
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_82
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz wart im ſchiere verkeret!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_83" id="v_83" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_83">v_83
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_83
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er wart vil gahes geneiget.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_84" id="v_84" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_84">v_84
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_84
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an im ſo wart ertzeiget,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_85" id="v_85" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_85">v_85
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_85
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Als an abſalone,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_86" id="v_86" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_86">v_86
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_86
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der die vppige krone
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_87" id="v_87" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_87">v_87
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_87
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ovch der werlde ſvzze
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_88" id="v_88" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_88">v_88
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_88
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gezvckete vnder die fvzze
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_89" id="v_89" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_89">v_89
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_89
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von ſiner hohſten werdikeit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_90" id="v_90" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_90">v_90
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_90
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an ein ſmeliches leit.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_91" id="v_91" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_91">v_91
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_91
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>az ſprichet an einer ſtat da:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_92" id="v_92" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_92">v_92
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_92
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Media vita
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_93" id="v_93" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_93">v_93
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_93
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn morte ſvmus.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_94" id="v_94" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_94">v_94
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_94
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz bedevtet vns alſus,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_95" id="v_95" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_95">v_95
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_95
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz wir in dem tode ſweben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_96" id="v_96" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_96">v_96
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_96
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo wir allerbeſt wenen leben.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_97" id="v_97" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_97">v_97
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_97
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dirre werlde veſte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_98" id="v_98" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_98">v_98
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_98
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſtete vnde beſte,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_99" id="v_99" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_99">v_99
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_99
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die aller hohſte mankraft,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_100" id="v_100" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_100">v_100
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_100
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ſtet ane meiſterſchaft.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_101" id="v_101" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_101">v_101
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_101
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz mvge wir an der kertzen ſehen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_102" id="v_102" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_102">v_102
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_102
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ein wares bilde geſchehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_103" id="v_103" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_103">v_103
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_103
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie zv einer aſchen wirt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_104" id="v_104" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_104">v_104
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_104
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vor vnſ, do ſie lieht birt.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_105" id="v_105" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_105">v_105
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_105
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wir ſin von broden ſachen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_106" id="v_106" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_106">v_106
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_106
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wartet, wie vnſer lachen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_107" id="v_107" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_107">v_107
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_107
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit weinen er liſchet.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_108" id="v_108" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_108">v_108
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_108
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer honic gemiſchet
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_109" id="v_109" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_109">v_109
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_109
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jſt mit bitter gallen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_110" id="v_110" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_110">v_110
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_110
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer blvme, die mvz vallen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_111" id="v_111" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_111">v_111
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_111
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So wir aller beſte wenen ſin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_112" id="v_112" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_112">v_112
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_112
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz wirt an dem herren heinrichē<span class="lb">|</span>¶ ſchin:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_113" id="v_113" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_113">v_113
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_113
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er in ſiner hohſten werde
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_114" id="v_114" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_114">v_114
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_114
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   lebte vf dirre erde,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_115" id="v_115" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_115">v_115
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_115
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_116" id="v_116" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_116">v_116
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_116
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_117" id="v_117" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_117">v_117
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_117
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_118" id="v_118" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_118">v_118
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_118
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_119" id="v_119" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_119">v_119
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_119
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do begreif in die miſelſucht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_120" id="v_120" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_120">v_120
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_120
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do man des waren gotes zvcht
   <br></span>





<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_121" id="v_121" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_121">v_121
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_121
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sach an ſinem libe,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_122" id="v_122" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_122">v_122
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_122
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Manne vnde wibe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_123" id="v_123" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_123">v_123
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_123
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wart er wider tzeme.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_124" id="v_124" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_124">v_124
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_124
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   warta, wie geneme
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_125" id="v_125" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_125">v_125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_125
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ê der werlde were,
   <br></span>
