         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_126
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er wart ir als vnmere,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_127" id="v_127" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_127">v_127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_127
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz man in vil vngerne ſach.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_128" id="v_128" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_128">v_128
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_128
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als ovch Job geſchach,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_129" id="v_129" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_129">v_129
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_129
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dem edelen vnd dem richen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_130" id="v_130" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_130">v_130
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_130
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der alſo iemerlichen
   <br></span>


