         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_151
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſin blvme mvſte vallen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_126a" id="v_126a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_126a">v_126a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_126a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ze hev wart im ſin grvnes gras.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_126b" id="v_126b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_126b">v_126b
