         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_156
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   be dakte ſiner ſvnnen blicke,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_153" id="v_153" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_153">v_153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_153
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ein ſwinde bitter donerſlac
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_154" id="v_154" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_154">v_154
