<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_156a" id="v_156a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_156a">v_156a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_156a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sin morgen ſterne der erlaſch.
   <br></span>
