         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_158
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ſo groze ere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_159" id="v_159" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_159">v_159
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_159
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Hinder im mvſte lazen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_160" id="v_160" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_160">v_160
