<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_173" id="v_173" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_173">v_173
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_173
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do fvr er alſo drate
