      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_182" id="v_182" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_182">v_182
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_182
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_184" id="v_184" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_184">v_184
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_184
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do hiez er vragen zehant
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_183" id="v_183" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_183">v_183
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_183
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nach den beſten meiſtern, die man<span class="lb">|</span>vant.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_185" id="v_185" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_185">v_185
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_185
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der ſait im do ein mere:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_186" id="v_186" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_186">v_186
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_186
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er were geneſebere
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_187" id="v_187" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_187">v_187
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_187
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ were doch immer vngeneſen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_188" id="v_188" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_188">v_188
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_188
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Maiſter, wie mac daz geweſen?‹,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_205" id="v_205" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_205">v_205
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_205
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sprach der arme heinrich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_206" id="v_206" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_206">v_206
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_206
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›war vmbe vntroſt ir mich?
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_189" id="v_189" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_189">v_189
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_189
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_190" id="v_190" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_190">v_190
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_190
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   bin ich geneſelich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_190a" id="v_190a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_190a">v_190a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_190a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſehet, ſo geneſe ich!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_191" id="v_191" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_191">v_191
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_191
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mir enwirt niht vor geleit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_192" id="v_192" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_192">v_192
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_192
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an gvte noch an arbeit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_193" id="v_193" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_193">v_193
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_193
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch entruwe iz wol vol bringen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_194" id="v_194" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_194">v_194
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_194
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an deheiner ſlahte dingen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_195" id="v_195" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_195">v_195
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_195
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_196" id="v_196" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_196">v_196
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_196
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_197" id="v_197" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_197">v_197
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_197
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_198" id="v_198" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_198">v_198
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_198
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_199" id="v_199" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_199">v_199
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_199
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_200" id="v_200" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_200">v_200
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_200
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_201" id="v_201" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_201">v_201
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_201
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_202" id="v_202" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_202">v_202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_202
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_207" id="v_207" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_207">v_207
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_207
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_208" id="v_208" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_208">v_208
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_208
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_209" id="v_209" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_209">v_209
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_209
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jrn wolt denne iwer reht brechen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_210" id="v_210" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_210">v_210
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_210
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ wolt an mir verſprechen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_211" id="v_211" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_211">v_211
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_211
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beide min ſilber vnd min golt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_212" id="v_212" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_212">v_212
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_212
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch mach ivch mir alſo holt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_213" id="v_213" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_213">v_213
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_213
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ir mich harte gerne nert.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_214" id="v_214" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_214">v_214
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_214
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Mir were der wille vnbewert‹,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_215" id="v_215" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_215">v_215
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_215
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sprach der meiſter aber do,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_216" id="v_216" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_216">v_216
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_216
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›were der artzedie ſo,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_217" id="v_217" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_217">v_217
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_217
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz man ſie veile fvnde
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_218" id="v_218" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_218">v_218
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_218
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder daz man ſie kvnde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_219" id="v_219" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_219">v_219
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_219
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit ichte erwerben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_220" id="v_220" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_220">v_220
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_220
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jchn liez vch niht verterben.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_221" id="v_221" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_221">v_221
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_221
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des mac leider niht geſin,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_222" id="v_222" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_222">v_222
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_222
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des mvͦz vch ſin die helfe min
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_223" id="v_223" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_223">v_223
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_223
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ane mine ſchvlde verſait.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_224" id="v_224" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_224">v_224
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_224
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr ſcholdet haben eine mait
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_225" id="v_225" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_225">v_225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_225
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vollen vriebere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_226" id="v_226" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_226">v_226
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_226
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die in dem willen were,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_227" id="v_227" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_227">v_227
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_227
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie den tot gerne lide,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_227a" id="v_227a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_227a">v_227a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_227a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz man ſie zwiſchen iren brvſten<span class="lb">|</span>ſnite.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_228" id="v_228" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_228">v_228
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_228
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv iſt es niht der werlde ſite,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_228a" id="v_228a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_228a">v_228a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_228a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   da von ſi wir in iamers mite
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_229" id="v_229" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_229">v_229
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_229
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz keine daz dvrch vch tv.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_230" id="v_230" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_230">v_230
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_230
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   danen hoͤret anders niht zv,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_231" id="v_231" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_231">v_231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_231
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan der reinen meide herzē blvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_232" id="v_232" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_232">v_232
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_232
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz were fvr eͮwer ſvche gvt.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_233" id="v_233" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_233">v_233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_233
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   d<span>D</span>O ſprach der arme heinrich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_234" id="v_234" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_234">v_234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_234
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz were gar vnmvgelich,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_235" id="v_235" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_235">v_235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_235
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ieman den erwurbe,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_236" id="v_236" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_236">v_236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_236
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der gerne vor in ſtvrbe
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_236a" id="v_236a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_236a">v_236a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_236a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde gar ver tvrbe.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_204" id="v_204" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_204">v_204
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_204
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Got der ſol der artzet weſen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_203" id="v_203" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_203">v_203
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_203
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder ich bin immer vngeneſen.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_237" id="v_237" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_237">v_237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_237
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſuſt wart im ſin troſt benvmen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_238" id="v_238" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_238">v_238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_238
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar vmbe er dar was bekvmen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_239" id="v_239" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_239">v_239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_239
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Donen hat er zv der ſelben vriſt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_240" id="v_240" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_240">v_240
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_240
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv ſines libes geniſt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_241" id="v_241" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_241">v_241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_241
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gegen in gedinges niht mer.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_242" id="v_242" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_242">v_242
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_242
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſin bitter herze wart ſo ſer
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_243" id="v_243" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_243">v_243
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_243
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ovch ſin iamer alſo groz,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_244" id="v_244" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_244">v_244
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_244
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz in der zit vil gar verdroz,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_245" id="v_245" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_245">v_245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_245
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er iht lenger ſolde leben.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_246" id="v_246" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_246">v_246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_246
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er fvr heim vn̄ begonde vergeben
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_247" id="v_247" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_247">v_247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_247
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   allez ſin varendes gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_248" id="v_248" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_248">v_248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_248
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Recht als in ſin ſelbes mvt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_249" id="v_249" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_249">v_249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_249
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ wiſer rat gelerte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_250" id="v_250" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_250">v_250
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_250
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So er iz aller beſte kerte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_250a" id="v_250a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_250a">v_250a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_250a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ſin heil merte.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_251" id="v_251" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_251">v_251
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_251
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er machte beſcheidenliche
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_252" id="v_252" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_252">v_252
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_252
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſine armen vrvnt riche
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_253" id="v_253" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_253">v_253
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_253
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde beriet ovch vremde armen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_254" id="v_254" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_254">v_254
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_254
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſich got liez erbarmen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_255" id="v_255" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_255">v_255
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_255
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Genediclichen vber der ſele heil.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_256" id="v_256" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_256">v_256
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_256
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   den kloͤſtern gab er daz beſte teil.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_256a" id="v_256a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_256a">v_256a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_256a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sinen liebeſten vrevnden zehant,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_256b" id="v_256b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_256b">v_256b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_256b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   den bevalch er bvrge vnde lant.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_257" id="v_257" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_257">v_257
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_257
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſuſt tet er ſich abe
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_258" id="v_258" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_258">v_258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_258
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   aller ſiner varnden habe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_260" id="v_260" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_260">v_260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_260
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde vloch zehant die levte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_259" id="v_259" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_259">v_259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_259
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   verre vf ein wilde gerevte.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_260a" id="v_260a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_260a">v_260a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_260a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er ſich von den levten gezoch<span class="editorial_note">Man beachte den Wechsel der Verbalpräfixe in den beiden Reimwörtern. Ba: zoch : gevloch, Bb: gezoch : vloch</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_260b" id="v_260b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_260b">v_260b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_260b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ verre in einen walt vloch,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_261" id="v_261" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_261">v_261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_261
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_262" id="v_262" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_262">v_262
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_262
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_263" id="v_263" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_263">v_263
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_263
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_264" id="v_264" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_264">v_264
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_264
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_265" id="v_265" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_265">v_265
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_265
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_266" id="v_266" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_266">v_266
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_266
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_267" id="v_267" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_267">v_267
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_267
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der daz ſelbe gerevte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_268" id="v_268" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_268">v_268
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_268
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn dem wilden walde boͮwete,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_269" id="v_269" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_269">v_269
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_269
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz was ein vrier bovman,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_270" id="v_270" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_270">v_270
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_270
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der vil ſelden ie gewan
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_271" id="v_271" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_271">v_271
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_271
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Je kein vngemach,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_272" id="v_272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_272">v_272
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_272
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz andern geboͮwern geſchach,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_273" id="v_273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_273">v_273
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_273
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die wirs geherret waren,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_274" id="v_274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_274">v_274
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_274
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo ſie des niht verbaren,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_275" id="v_275" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_275">v_275
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_275
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie geben ſchos vnd ovch die bete.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_276" id="v_276" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_276">v_276
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_276
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz dirre bovman gerne tete,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_277" id="v_277" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_277">v_277
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_277
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz nam ſin herre fvr|gvtfvrgvtfvr gvt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_278" id="v_278" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_278">v_278
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_278
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan er in allez vber <span class="del"><span class="unclear"></span></span> trvc,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_279" id="v_279" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_279">v_279
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_279
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er deheine arbeit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_280" id="v_280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_280">v_280
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_280
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von fremdem gewalte nie geleit.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_282" id="v_282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_282">v_282
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_282
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Deſen was in den richen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_281" id="v_281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_281">v_281
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_281
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnder allen ſinen gelichen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_283" id="v_283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_283">v_283
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_283
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dehein bovman alſo rich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_284" id="v_284" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_284">v_284
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_284
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv dem zoch ſich der arme heinrich.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_285" id="v_285" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_285">v_285
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_285
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>S</span>waz er im vor hatte verſpart,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_286" id="v_286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_286">v_286
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_286
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie wol im daz vergolden wart!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_287" id="v_287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_287">v_287
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_287
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_288" id="v_288" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_288">v_288
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_288
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_289" id="v_289" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_289">v_289
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_289
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_290" id="v_290" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_290">v_290
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_290
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_291" id="v_291" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_291">v_291
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_291
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_292" id="v_292" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_292">v_292
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_292
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_293" id="v_293" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_293">v_293
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_293
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_294" id="v_294" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_294">v_294
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_294
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_295" id="v_295" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_295">v_295
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_295
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Got hatte dem meẏer gegeben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_296" id="v_296" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_296">v_296
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_296
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn allen wis ein reines leben.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_297" id="v_297" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_297">v_297
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_297
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er hatte wol einen arbeiten lip
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_298" id="v_298" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_298">v_298
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_298
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ein wol werbendes wip,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_299" id="v_299" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_299">v_299
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_299
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dar zv hat er ſchone kint,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_300" id="v_300" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_300">v_300
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_300
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die gar des mannes vrevde ſint.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_302" id="v_302" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_302">v_302
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_302
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnder den zoch er ein mait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_301" id="v_301" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_301">v_301
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_301
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als vns ditz buch hat geſait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_303" id="v_303" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_303">v_303
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_303
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wol von zwelf iaren.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_304" id="v_304" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_304">v_304
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_304
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie konde wol gebaren
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_305" id="v_305" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_305">v_305
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_305
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So rechte gvtlichen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_306" id="v_306" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_306">v_306
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_306
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie wolde nie niht wichen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_307" id="v_307" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_307">v_307
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_307
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von irem herren einen fvz.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_308" id="v_308" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_308">v_308
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_308
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vmb ſine hvlde vn̄ ſinen grvz
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_309" id="v_309" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_309">v_309
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_309
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Diente ſie im alle wege
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_310" id="v_310" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_310">v_310
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_310
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mit irre gvtlichen phlege.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_315" id="v_315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_315">v_315
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_315
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die andern hatten den ſin,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_316" id="v_316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_316">v_316
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_316
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie zv rechter maze in
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_317" id="v_317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_317">v_317
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_317
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wol gemiden kvnden.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_318" id="v_318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_318">v_318
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_318
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo vloch ſie zallen ſtvnden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_319" id="v_319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_319">v_319
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_319
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv im vnd nirgen anderſwar.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_320" id="v_320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_320">v_320
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_320
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie was ſin kvrtzewile gar
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_311" id="v_311" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_311">v_311
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_311
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ was ovch ſo geneme,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_312" id="v_312" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_312">v_312
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_312
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie wol zeme
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_313" id="v_313" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_313">v_313
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_313
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv kinde einem riche.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_314" id="v_314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_314">v_314
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_314
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit ſchoner we<span class="del">r</span>tlichewetlichewertliche
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_321" id="v_321" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_321">v_321
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_321
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So hatte ſie ir gemvte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_322" id="v_322" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_322">v_322
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_322
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mit reiner kindes gv̂te
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_323" id="v_323" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_323">v_323
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_323
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   An iren ſiechen herren gewant,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_324" id="v_324" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_324">v_324
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_324
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz man ſie ſelten irgen vant,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_325" id="v_325" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_325">v_325
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_325
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Danne zv ſinen fvͦzen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_326" id="v_326" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_326">v_326
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_326
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mit ſvͤzzer vnmvͦzen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_327" id="v_327" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_327">v_327
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_327
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wonte ſie irem herren bi,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_328" id="v_328" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_328">v_328
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_328
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar zv liebet er ſi,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_329" id="v_329" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_329">v_329
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_329
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swo mit ſo er mohte:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_330" id="v_330" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_330">v_330
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_330
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz der meide tohte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_331" id="v_331" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_331">v_331
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_331
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv irem kintlichen ſpil,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_332" id="v_332" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_332">v_332
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_332
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des gewan er ir vil.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_333" id="v_333" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_333">v_333
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_333
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_334" id="v_334" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_334">v_334
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_334
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_335" id="v_335" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_335">v_335
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_335
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er kovfet ir, waz man veiles vant:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_336" id="v_336" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_336">v_336
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_336
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gurtel vnde harbant,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_338" id="v_338" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_338">v_338
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_338
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Spiegel vnde vingerlin,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_337" id="v_337" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_337">v_337
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_337
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz kinden liep ſcholde ſin.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_339" id="v_339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_339">v_339
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_339
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit dienſte bracht ſiz an die vart,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_340" id="v_340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_340">v_340
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_340
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ir alſo holt wart,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_341" id="v_341" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_341">v_341
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_341
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er ſie niht wan gemale hiez.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_342" id="v_342" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_342">v_342
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_342
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   owe, wie ſelten in do liez
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_343" id="v_343" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_343">v_343
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_343
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die gvte mait aleine:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_344" id="v_344" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_344">v_344
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_344
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er dovchte ſie vil reine.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_345" id="v_345" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_345">v_345
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_345
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swie ſere aber iz imir riet<span class="editorial_note">Die Hs. hat  im, doch der Bezug auf Heinrich ergibt hier keinen Sinn; hier hat Ba die richtige Lesart: ir riet</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_346" id="v_346" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_346">v_346
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_346
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   diſe kintliche miet,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_347" id="v_347" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_347">v_347
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_347
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So qvam ir doch aller meiſt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_348" id="v_348" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_348">v_348
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_348
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von gotes gabe ein ſvzzer geiſt.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_349" id="v_349" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_349">v_349
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_349
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr dienſt wart alſo gvtlich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_350" id="v_350" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_350">v_350
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_350
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do der arme heinrich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_351" id="v_351" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_351">v_351
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_351
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Drev iar daz entwelte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_352" id="v_352" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_352">v_352
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_352
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   got vil ſere qvelte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_353" id="v_353" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_353">v_353
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_353
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit grozen ſeren ſinen lip.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_354" id="v_354" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_354">v_354
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_354
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   eines tages ſaz der meyer vnd ſin wip
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_355" id="v_355" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_355">v_355
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_355
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ir tochter, die mait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_356" id="v_356" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_356">v_356
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_356
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als vnſ ditz bvch hat geſait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_357" id="v_357" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_357">v_357
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_357
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do bi e an einer mvzikeit<span class="editorial_note">Das lose  e  der Handschrift ist offenbar ein falscher Wortansatz, daher streichen wir es. Tilgungsmarkierungen
      fehlen generell in dieser Handschrift</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_358" id="v_358" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_358">v_358
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_358
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde weinden ires herren leit.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_359" id="v_359" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_359">v_359
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_359
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz klaiten ſie, daz tet in not:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_360" id="v_360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_360">v_360
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_360
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie vorchten, daz ires herren tot
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_361" id="v_361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_361">v_361
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_361
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sere begonde ſie letzen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_362" id="v_362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_362">v_362
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_362
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ ovch vil lichte entſetzen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_363" id="v_363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_363">v_363
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_363
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von allem irem gvte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_364" id="v_364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_364">v_364
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_364
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd daz ovch von herterem mvte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_365" id="v_365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_365">v_365
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_365
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wurde ein ander herre.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_366" id="v_366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_366">v_366
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_366
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie klaiten alſo ſere,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_367" id="v_367" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_367">v_367
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_367
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz der ſelbe bovman
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_368" id="v_368" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_368">v_368
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_368
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſinen herren fragen began.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_369" id="v_369" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_369">v_369
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_369
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ſprach: ›vil lieber herre min,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_370" id="v_370" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_370">v_370
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_370
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mocht iz mit iwern hvlden ſin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_371" id="v_371" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_371">v_371
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_371
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So fragt ich vch vil gerne,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_372" id="v_372" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_372">v_372
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_372
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo vil ſo zv ſalerne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_373" id="v_373" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_373">v_373
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_373
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von artzedie meiſter iſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_374" id="v_374" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_374">v_374
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_374
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz vch ir deheines liſt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_375" id="v_375" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_375">v_375
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_375
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv ewerm geſvnde
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_376" id="v_376" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_376">v_376
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_376
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nie niht gehelfen kvnde,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_377" id="v_377" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_377">v_377
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_377
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Lieber herre, des wundert mich.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_378" id="v_378" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_378">v_378
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_378
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do holte der arme heinrich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_379" id="v_379" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_379">v_379
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_379
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Einen tiefen ſuftz von herzen;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_380" id="v_380" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_380">v_380
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_380
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   den iemerlichen ſmerzen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_380a" id="v_380a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_380a">v_380a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_380a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den wiſte er mit den ovgen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_380b" id="v_380b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_380b">v_380b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_380b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ſprach: ›vrevnt, daz iſt ane lovgen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_381" id="v_381" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_381">v_381
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_381
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_382" id="v_382" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_382">v_382
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_382
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>





<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_383" id="v_383" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_383">v_383
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_383
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich diſen ſchemelichen ſpot
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_384" id="v_384" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_384">v_384
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_384
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   habe verdienet vmbe got.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_385" id="v_385" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_385">v_385
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_385
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dv weiſt wol, daz hie bevor
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_386" id="v_386" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_386">v_386
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_386
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſtvnt vil offen min tor
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_387" id="v_387" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_387">v_387
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_387
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit mancher hande wunne.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_388" id="v_388" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_388">v_388
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_388
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ezn hatte vnder minem kvnne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_389" id="v_389" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_389">v_389
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_389
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sinen willen nieman baz dan ich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_390" id="v_390" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_390">v_390
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_390
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz was harte vnmvgelich.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_391" id="v_391" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_391">v_391
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_391
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Minen willen hatte ich mit vrowē gar.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_392" id="v_392" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_392">v_392
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_392
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ja nam ich des vil kleine war,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_393" id="v_393" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_393">v_393
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_393
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der mir ditz wunſchliches leben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_394" id="v_394" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_394">v_394
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_394
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von ſinen genaden hat gegeben.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_395" id="v_395" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_395">v_395
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_395
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do mir min hof als offen ſtvnt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_396" id="v_396" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_396">v_396
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_396
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als aller werlde toren tvnt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_397" id="v_397" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_397">v_397
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_397
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den da retet ir tvmber mvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_398" id="v_398" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_398">v_398
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_398
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie ere vnde gvt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_399" id="v_399" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_399">v_399
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_399
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wider got wellen han.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_400" id="v_400" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_400">v_400
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_400
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo betrovc mich min tvmb ͛ wan.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_401" id="v_401" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_401">v_401
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_401
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_402" id="v_402" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_402">v_402
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_402
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_403" id="v_403" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_403">v_403
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_403
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_404" id="v_404" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_404">v_404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_404
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_405" id="v_405" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_405">v_405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_405
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do des den hohen got ver droz,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_406" id="v_406" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_406">v_406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_406
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der ſelden pforten er mir beſloz;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_407" id="v_407" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_407">v_407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_407
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Donen kvm ich leider nimm͛ hin,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_408" id="v_408" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_408">v_408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_408
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ver los mir min tvmber ſin.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_409" id="v_409" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_409">v_409
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_409
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv hat got rache an mich geleit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_410" id="v_410" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_410">v_410
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_410
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ſmehelichen ſiecheit,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_411" id="v_411" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_411">v_411
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_411
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die nieman mac erloſen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_412" id="v_412" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_412">v_412
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_412
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv verſmahe ich den boſen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_413" id="v_413" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_413">v_413
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_413
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die frvmen gern min niht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_414" id="v_414" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_414">v_414
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_414
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie kranc er iſt, der mich geſiht,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_415" id="v_415" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_415">v_415
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_415
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des boſer mvz ich dannoch ſin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_416" id="v_416" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_416">v_416
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_416
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alrerſt nv leſtu werden ſchin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_417" id="v_417" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_417">v_417
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_417
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_418" id="v_418" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_418">v_418
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_418
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_419" id="v_419" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_419">v_419
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_419
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die grozen treͮwe, die dv haſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_420" id="v_420" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_420">v_420
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_420
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz dv mich ſiechen bi dir haſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_421" id="v_421" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_421">v_421
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_421
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wie wenic dv mich vlevheſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_422" id="v_422" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_422">v_422
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_422
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie lvtzel dv mich ſchevheſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_423" id="v_423" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_423">v_423
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_423
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wie gerne daz ich ſi bi dir,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_424" id="v_424" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_424">v_424
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_424
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie vil dines dinges ſtet an mir.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_425" id="v_425" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_425">v_425
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_425
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So vber ſechſtv doch wol minen tot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_426" id="v_426" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_426">v_426
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_426
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wes vnwerde vnde wes not
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_427" id="v_427" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_427">v_427
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_427
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wart zv der werlde grozer mere?
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_428" id="v_428" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_428">v_428
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_428
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hie vor was ich din herre,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_429" id="v_429" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_429">v_429
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_429
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Din dvrftige ſo bin ich nv.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_430" id="v_430" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_430">v_430
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_430
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vil lieber vrevnt, nv kovfes dv,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_431" id="v_431" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_431">v_431
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_431
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Min gemale vnd din wip
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_432" id="v_432" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_432">v_432
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_432
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an mir den ewigen lip,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_433" id="v_433" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_433">v_433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_433
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz dv mir ſiechen bi dir laſt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_434" id="v_434" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_434">v_434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_434
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des dv mich gefraget haſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_435" id="v_435" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_435">v_435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_435
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſag ich dir vil gerne:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_436" id="v_436" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_436">v_436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_436
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jchn konde zv Salerne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_437" id="v_437" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_437">v_437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_437
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Einen meiſter nirgen vinden,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_438" id="v_438" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_438">v_438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_438
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der ſich min vnder winden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_439" id="v_439" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_439">v_439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_439
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Torſte oder wolde,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_440" id="v_440" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_440">v_440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_440
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mit der geniſt, der ich ſcholde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_441" id="v_441" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_441">v_441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_441
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an miner ſvche geneſen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_442" id="v_442" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_442">v_442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_442
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz mvz ein ſvlche ſache weſen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_443" id="v_443" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_443">v_443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_443
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie in der werlde kein man
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_444" id="v_444" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_444">v_444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_444
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit keiner habe er werben kan.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_445" id="v_445" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_445">v_445
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_445
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mir wart anders niht geſait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_446" id="v_446" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_446">v_446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_446
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch ſolde haben eine mait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_447" id="v_447" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_447">v_447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_447
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die in dem willen were,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_448" id="v_448" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_448">v_448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_448
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie niht verbere,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_449" id="v_449" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_449">v_449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_449
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie den tot gerne lite,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_450" id="v_450" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_450">v_450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_450
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz man ſie zwiſchen iren brvſten ſni<span class="lb">|</span>||te.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_451" id="v_451" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_451">v_451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_451
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_452" id="v_452" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_452">v_452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_452
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_453" id="v_453" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_453">v_453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_453
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv were daz vnmvgelich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_454" id="v_454" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_454">v_454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_454
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz immer keine dvrch mich
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_455" id="v_455" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_455">v_455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_455
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gerne lide den tot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_456" id="v_456" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_456">v_456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_456
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des mvz ich diſe ſchemeliche not
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_457" id="v_457" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_457">v_457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_457
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Tragen biz an min ende.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_458" id="v_458" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_458">v_458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_458
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz mir got ſchire geſende.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_459" id="v_459" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_459">v_459
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_459
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er ſinem maẏer hatte geſait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_460" id="v_460" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_460">v_460
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_460
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz hort die<span class="del">ir</span>dieir torchter, die mait.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_461" id="v_461" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_461">v_461
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_461
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do hatte die vil ſvͤzze
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_462" id="v_462" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_462">v_462
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_462
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jres ſiechen herren fvͤzze
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_463" id="v_463" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_463">v_463
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_463
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sten vf irem ſchoze.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_464" id="v_464" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_464">v_464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_464
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz mohte ſich genozen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_465" id="v_465" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_465">v_465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_465
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv irem kintlichem gemvͤte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_466" id="v_466" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_466">v_466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_466
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wen aller engel gvͤte.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_468" id="v_468" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_468">v_468
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_468
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Diſe rede merkete ſie gar
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_467" id="v_467" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_467">v_467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_467
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde nam ir in irem herzen war,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_469" id="v_469" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_469">v_469
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_469
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſiez vz irem herzen nie gelie
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_470" id="v_470" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_470">v_470
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_470
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   biz ſie des nachtes ſlafen gie.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_471" id="v_471" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_471">v_471
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_471
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv irs vaters fvͤzen do ſie lac
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_472" id="v_472" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_472">v_472
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_472
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ zv irre mvter, als ſie pflac.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_473" id="v_473" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_473">v_473
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_473
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ſie beide ſliefen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_474" id="v_474" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_474">v_474
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_474
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Manchen ſuftz tiefen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_475" id="v_475" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_475">v_475
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_475
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   holte ſie von herzen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_476" id="v_476" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_476">v_476
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_476
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   den iemerlichen ſmerzen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_476a" id="v_476a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_476a">v_476a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_476a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wiſte ſie mit den ovgen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_476b" id="v_476b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_476b">v_476b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_476b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz was ane lovgen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_477" id="v_477" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_477">v_477
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_477
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr iamer daz wart alſo groz,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_478" id="v_478" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_478">v_478
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_478
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir der ovgen regen vloz
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_479" id="v_479" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_479">v_479
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_479
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vf der ſlafenden fvzen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_480" id="v_480" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_480">v_480
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_480
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do erwachten die ſvzen,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_481" id="v_481" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_481">v_481
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_481
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ſie der trehne entſtvnden,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_482" id="v_482" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_482">v_482
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_482
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   fragen <span class="del">ſi</span> ſie begvnden,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_483" id="v_483" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_483">v_483
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_483
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz ir geſchehen were
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_484" id="v_484" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_484">v_484
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_484
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder welcher hande ſwere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_485" id="v_485" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_485">v_485
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_485
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie alſo tovgen klagete.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_486" id="v_486" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_486">v_486
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_486
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Owe, wie vngerne ſie iz ſagete,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_487" id="v_487" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_487">v_487
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_487
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wan daz ir der vater tet
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_488" id="v_488" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_488">v_488
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_488
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beide mit treͮwe vnd mit bet,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_489" id="v_489" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_489">v_489
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_489
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie iz in mvſte ſagen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_490" id="v_490" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_490">v_490
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_490
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie ſprach: ›ir mocht wol mit mir kla<span class="lb">|</span>||gen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_491" id="v_491" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_491">v_491
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_491
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Waz kan vnſ gewerren mere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_492" id="v_492" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_492">v_492
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_492
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wen vmb vnſern herren!
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_494" id="v_494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_494">v_494
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_494
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Schvlle wir den verkieſen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_493" id="v_493" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_493">v_493
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_493
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ ovch mit im verlieſen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_495" id="v_495" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_495">v_495
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_495
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beide gvt vnd ere?
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_496" id="v_496" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_496">v_496
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_496
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ja gewinne wir nimmer mere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_497" id="v_497" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_497">v_497
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_497
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Deheinen herren alſo gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_498" id="v_498" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_498">v_498
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_498
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der vns tv, daz er vns tvt.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_499" id="v_499" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_499">v_499
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_499
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie ſprachen: ›tohter, dv haſt war.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_500" id="v_500" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_500">v_500
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_500
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv en iſt vns niht als vmb ein har
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_501" id="v_501" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_501">v_501
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_501
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer weinen vnd vnſer klage.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_502" id="v_502" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_502">v_502
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_502
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   liebes kint, da von gedage;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_503" id="v_503" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_503">v_503
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_503
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz iſt vns leit als dir.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_504" id="v_504" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_504">v_504
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_504
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   leider nv enkvnne wir
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_505" id="v_505" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_505">v_505
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_505
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jm zv ſtaten niht kvmen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_506" id="v_506" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_506">v_506
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_506
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   got, der hat in vnſ benvmen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_507" id="v_507" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_507">v_507
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_507
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   het iz anders ieman getan,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_508" id="v_508" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_508">v_508
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_508
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der mvſte vnſern vluch han.‹
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_509" id="v_509" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_509">v_509
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_509
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do mite wart ſie geſweiget do.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_510" id="v_510" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_510">v_510
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_510
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die nacht beleip ſie vnvro
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_511" id="v_511" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_511">v_511
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_511
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Biz an den andern tak.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_512" id="v_512" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_512">v_512
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_512
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſwez aber ieman pflac,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_513" id="v_513" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_513">v_513
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_513
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do qvam iz ir vz dem herzen nie,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_514" id="v_514" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_514">v_514
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_514
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   biz daz ſie aber ſlafen gie,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_515" id="v_515" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_515">v_515
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_515
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des nachtes, nach gewonheit.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_516" id="v_516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_516">v_516
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_516
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_517" id="v_517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_517">v_517
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_517
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_518" id="v_518" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_518">v_518
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_518
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie hatte ir aber ein bat bereit
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_519" id="v_519" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_519">v_519
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_519
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit weinenden ovgen:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_520" id="v_520" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_520">v_520
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_520
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie trvc alſo tovgen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_521" id="v_521" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_521">v_521
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_521
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Neheſt irem gemvte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_522" id="v_522" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_522">v_522
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_522
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die alwerſten gvte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_523" id="v_523" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_523">v_523
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_523
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die ie kein man ie vernam.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_524" id="v_524" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_524">v_524
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_524
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wo getet ie kint alſam?
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_525" id="v_525" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_525">v_525
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_525
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wan ſie ſich gar des erwac,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_526" id="v_526" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_526">v_526
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_526
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gelebte ſie den andern tak,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_527" id="v_527" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_527">v_527
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_527
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie ſanzehant ir leben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_528" id="v_528" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_528">v_528
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_528
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vor iren herren wolde geben!
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_529" id="v_529" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_529">v_529
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_529
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>U</span>On dem gedinge wart ſie do
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_530" id="v_530" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_530">v_530
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_530
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ringes mvtes vn̄ vro
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_531" id="v_531" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_531">v_531
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_531
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde hatte deheine ſwere me,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_532" id="v_532" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_532">v_532
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_532
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan eine klage, die tet ir we:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_532a" id="v_532a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_532a">v_532a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_532a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz was ir groſte ſorgen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_532b" id="v_532b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_532b">v_532b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_532b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan ſiez an dem morgen
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_533" id="v_533" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_533">v_533
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_533
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jrem herren ſagete,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_534" id="v_534" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_534">v_534
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_534
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie vorchte, daz er verzagete,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_535" id="v_535" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_535">v_535
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_535
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So ſiez in allen tete kvnt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_536" id="v_536" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_536">v_536
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_536
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie an der ſelben ſtvnt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_537" id="v_537" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_537">v_537
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_537
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der ſtate niht enfvnde.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_538" id="v_538" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_538">v_538
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_538
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des wart an der ſtvnde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_539" id="v_539" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_539">v_539
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_539
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Alſo groz ir vngehabe,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_540" id="v_540" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_540">v_540
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_540
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir mvter dar abe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_541" id="v_541" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_541">v_541
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_541
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ ir vater wart er wacht,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_542" id="v_542" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_542">v_542
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_542
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als an der vordern naht.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_543" id="v_543" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_543">v_543
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_543
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie richten ſich vf zv ir,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_544" id="v_544" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_544">v_544
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_544
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie ſprachen: ›ſe, waz wirret dir?
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_545" id="v_545" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_545">v_545
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_545
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dv biſt vil alwere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_546" id="v_546" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_546">v_546
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_546
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz dv dir ſo manche ſwere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_547" id="v_547" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_547">v_547
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_547
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn din klage haſt genvmen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_548" id="v_548" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_548">v_548
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_548
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der nieman mac zv ende kvmen!
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_549" id="v_549" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_549">v_549
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_549
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   war vmbe leſtu vnſ niht ſlafen?‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_550" id="v_550" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_550">v_550
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_550
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſvſt begonden ſie die mait ſtrafen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_551" id="v_551" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_551">v_551
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_551
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz ir die rede tochte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_552" id="v_552" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_552">v_552
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_552
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die nieman enmohte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_553" id="v_553" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_553">v_553
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_553
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er wenden noch gebvͤzzen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_554" id="v_554" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_554">v_554
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_554
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſvſt wanten ſie die ſvzzen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_555" id="v_555" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_555">v_555
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_555
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   haben geſweiget an der ſtvnt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_556" id="v_556" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_556">v_556
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_556
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr wille waſ in vil vnkvnt.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_557" id="v_557" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_557">v_557
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_557
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des antwort in die ſchone mait:
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_558" id="v_558" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_558">v_558
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_558
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›als vnſ min herre hat geſait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_559" id="v_559" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_559">v_559
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_559
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den traw ich harte wol ernern,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_560" id="v_560" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_560">v_560
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_560
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jrn wollet mir iz danne wern.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_562" id="v_562" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_562">v_562
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_562
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch bin ein mait vnd han den mvt:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_561" id="v_561" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_561">v_561
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_561
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv ſiner artzedie bin ich gvt.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_563" id="v_563" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_563">v_563
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_563
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   E· ich in liezze ver terben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_564" id="v_564" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_564">v_564
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_564
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wolde e| vor in ſterben.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_565" id="v_565" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_565">v_565
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_565
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von dem gedanken wurden <span class="del"><span class="unclear">vrô</span></span><span class="del">do</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_566" id="v_566" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_566">v_566
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_566
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beide trvric vnd vnvro,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_567" id="v_567" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_567">v_567
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_567
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr mvter vnd ir vater.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_568" id="v_568" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_568">v_568
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_568
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſin tochter, die bat er,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_569" id="v_569" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_569">v_569
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_569
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie die rede lieze
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_570" id="v_570" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_570">v_570
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_570
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ irem herren daz gehieze,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_571" id="v_571" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_571">v_571
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_571
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie geleiſten mohte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_572" id="v_572" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_572">v_572
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_572
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan ir ditz niht entohte.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_573" id="v_573" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_573">v_573
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_573
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ſprach: ›tochter, dv biſt ein kint.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_574" id="v_574" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_574">v_574
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_574
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die rewe dine, die ſint
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_575" id="v_575" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_575">v_575
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_575
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ze groz an diſen dingen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_576" id="v_576" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_576">v_576
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_576
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dvnen macht ſin niht vol bringen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_576a" id="v_576a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_576a">v_576a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_576a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der tot en iſt ſo ſenfte niht
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_576b" id="v_576b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_576b">v_576b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_576b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als dir din tvmber wan vergiht.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_577" id="v_577" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_577">v_577
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_577
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_578" id="v_578" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_578">v_578
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_578
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_579" id="v_579" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_579">v_579
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_579
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swen iz kvmet an die vriſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_580" id="v_580" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_580">v_580
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_580
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſin niht lenger rat iſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_581" id="v_581" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_581">v_581
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_581
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dvnen mvzzeſt erſterben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_582" id="v_582" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_582">v_582
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_582
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mohteſt dv danne erwerben,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_583" id="v_583" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_583">v_583
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_583
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz dv lebetes dennoch,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_584" id="v_584" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_584">v_584
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_584
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dv qveme nie in leit noch.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_585" id="v_585" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_585">v_585
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_585
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Tv zv dinen mvnt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_586" id="v_586" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_586">v_586
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_586
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz dv ſin nach dirre ſtvnt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_587" id="v_587" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_587">v_587
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_587
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nimmer mere werdeſt lvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_588" id="v_588" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_588">v_588
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_588
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder iz get dir vf dine hvt!‹
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_589" id="v_589" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_589">v_589
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_589
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hie wante er ſie do
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_590" id="v_590" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_590">v_590
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_590
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beide mit bet vnd mit dro
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_591" id="v_591" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_591">v_591
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_591
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Geſweiget han. donen moht er.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_592" id="v_592" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_592">v_592
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_592
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des antworte im die tochter,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_593" id="v_593" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_593">v_593
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_593
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie ſprach: ›vater, wie tvmp ich ſi,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_594" id="v_594" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_594">v_594
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_594
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo wont mir doch die witze bi.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_595" id="v_595" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_595">v_595
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_595
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ir mir ſait von dirre not,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_596" id="v_596" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_596">v_596
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_596
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch weiz wol, daz des libes tot
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_597" id="v_597" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_597">v_597
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_597
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jſt ſtark vnde ſtrenge.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_598" id="v_598" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_598">v_598
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_598
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſwer aber dan die lenge
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_599" id="v_599" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_599">v_599
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_599
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit vngemache leben ſol,
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_600" id="v_600" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_600">v_600
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_600
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dem iſt ovch niht ze wol.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_601" id="v_601" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_601">v_601
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_601
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swer ſo dar niht ringet,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_602" id="v_602" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_602">v_602
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_602
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er vf den alter bringet
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_603" id="v_603" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_603">v_603
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_603
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den lip mit micheler not,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_604" id="v_604" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_604">v_604
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_604
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo mvz er doch ligen tot;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_605" id="v_605" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_605">v_605
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_605
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd hat er dan die ſele verlorn,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_606" id="v_606" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_606">v_606
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_606
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo were im bezzer vngeborn.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_606a" id="v_606a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_606a">v_606a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_606a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz truwe ich eine wol bewarn
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_606b" id="v_606b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_606b">v_606b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_606b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ als tvmbe baz gevarn.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_607" id="v_607" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_607">v_607
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_607
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz iſt mir kvmen vf ein zil,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_608" id="v_608" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_608">v_608
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_608
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich ſin got loben wil,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_609" id="v_609" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_609">v_609
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_609
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich den kvrtzen lip mac gegeben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_610" id="v_610" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_610">v_610
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_610
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vmbe daz ewige leben.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_611" id="v_611" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_611">v_611
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_611
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz enſchvlt ir mir niht leiden.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_612" id="v_612" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_612">v_612
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_612
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil mir vnd vch beiden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_613" id="v_613" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_613">v_613
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_613
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   harte wol mit varn.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_614" id="v_614" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_614">v_614
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_614
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch traw iz eine wol bewarn
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_615" id="v_615" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_615">v_615
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_615
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vor ſchaden vnd vor leide,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_616" id="v_616" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_616">v_616
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_616
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als ich evch beſcheide:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_617" id="v_617" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_617">v_617
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_617
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wir haben ere vnde gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_618" id="v_618" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_618">v_618
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_618
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz meinet mines herzen mvt,<span class="editorial_note">Obschon A herren mut hat und in den folgenden Versen tatsächlich vom Herren die Rede ist, passt herzen mvt ebenso gut und den Schreiber von Bb, der es in Ba so las, hat es auch nicht gestört</span>
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_619" id="v_619" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_619">v_619
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_619
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wan er vnſ nie leit geſprach
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_620" id="v_620" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_620">v_620
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_620
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd vnſ daz gvt nie abe gebrach.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_621" id="v_621" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_621">v_621
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_621
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die wile er vnſ leben ſol,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_622" id="v_622" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_622">v_622
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_622
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo ſtet vnſer ſache wol.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_623" id="v_623" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_623">v_623
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_623
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Liez wir in vnſ erſterben,<span class="editorial_note">Bb scheint das in von Ba in ein vnſ geändert zu haben. Doch das ergibt keinen Sinn. Wir meinen, dass der Schreiber beim
      Hinzufügen des  vnſ  das in vergessen hat, und tragen es nach</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_624" id="v_624" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_624">v_624
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_624
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo mvſte wir verderben.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_625" id="v_625" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_625">v_625
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_625
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den wil ich vnſ vriſten
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_626" id="v_626" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_626">v_626
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_626
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mit alſo gvten liſten,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_627" id="v_627" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_627">v_627
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_627
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do mit wir alle ſin ge<span class="del">w</span><span class="del">n</span>eſengeweſengeneſen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_628" id="v_628" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_628">v_628
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_628
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv gvnnet mirz, wan iz mvz weſen.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_629" id="v_629" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_629">v_629
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_629
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die mvter weinende ſprach,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_630" id="v_630" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_630">v_630
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_630
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſie des kindes ernſt ſach:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_631" id="v_631" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_631">v_631
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_631
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Ge denket, tochter, liebes kint,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_632" id="v_632" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_632">v_632
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_632
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie groz die arbeite ſint,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_633" id="v_633" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_633">v_633
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_633
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die ich dvrch dich erliden han.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_634" id="v_634" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_634">v_634
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_634
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   loz mich ein bezzer lon enpfan,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_635" id="v_635" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_635">v_635
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_635
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dan ich dich hore ſprechen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_636" id="v_636" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_636">v_636
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_636
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dv wilt min herze brechen!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_637" id="v_637" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_637">v_637
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_637
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Senfte mir der rede ein teil.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_638" id="v_638" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_638">v_638
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_638
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dv wilt allez din heil
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_639" id="v_639" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_639">v_639
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_639
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   An mir ver wurken hin ze got.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_640" id="v_640" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_640">v_640
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_640
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gedenkeſt dv an ſin gebot?
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_641" id="v_641" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_641">v_641
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_641
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ja gebot vnd bat er,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_642" id="v_642" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_642">v_642
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_642
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz man mvter vnde vater
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_643" id="v_643" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_643">v_643
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_643
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ere ſchvlle erbieten,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_644" id="v_644" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_644">v_644
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_644
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ geheizet daz zv mieten,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_645" id="v_645" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_645">v_645
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_645
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz iſ der ſele geniſt werde
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_646" id="v_646" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_646">v_646
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_646
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ ein lanch leben vf der erde<span class="del">n</span>erdenerde.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_647" id="v_647" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_647">v_647
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_647
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dv gihſt, dv welles din leben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_648" id="v_648" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_648">v_648
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_648
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vmb vnſer zweier vrevde geben;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_649" id="v_649" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_649">v_649
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_649
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do mite wiltu vnſ beiden
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_650" id="v_650" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_650">v_650
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_650
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz leben ſere leiden.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_651" id="v_651" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_651">v_651
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_651
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz din vater vnd ich
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_652" id="v_652" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_652">v_652
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_652
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gerne leben, daz iſt dvrch dich.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_652a" id="v_652a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_652a">v_652a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_652a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_652b" id="v_652b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_652b">v_652b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_652b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_652c" id="v_652c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_652c">v_652c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_652c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_652d" id="v_652d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_652d">v_652d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_652d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_653" id="v_653" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_653">v_653
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_653
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dv ſolt, liebe tohter min,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_654" id="v_654" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_654">v_654
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_654
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer beide vrevde ſin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_654a" id="v_654a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_654a">v_654a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_654a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer liebe ane leide,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_654b" id="v_654b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_654b">v_654b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_654b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer liecht der ovgen weide,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_655" id="v_655" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_655">v_655
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_655
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer herzen wunne,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_656" id="v_656" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_656">v_656
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_656
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ein blvme vnder dinem kvnne,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_657" id="v_657" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_657">v_657
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_657
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſers alters ein ſtap.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_658" id="v_658" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_658">v_658
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_658
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   leſtu vnſ vber din grap
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_659" id="v_659" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_659">v_659
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_659
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sten von dinen ſchvlden.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_660" id="v_660" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_660">v_660
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_660
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo biſt dv von gotes hvlden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_661" id="v_661" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_661">v_661
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_661
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jmmer me geſcheiden;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_662" id="v_662" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_662">v_662
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_662
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ver dienſt dv an vnſ beiden!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_662a" id="v_662a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_662a">v_662a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_662a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wiltu vnſ, tochter, weſen gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_662b" id="v_662b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_662b">v_662b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_662b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo ſoltu die rede vnd ovch den mvt
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_662c" id="v_662c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_662c">v_662c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_662c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dvrch vnſers herren hvlde lan,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_662d" id="v_662d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_662d">v_662d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_662d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ich von dir vernvmen han.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_663" id="v_663" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_663">v_663
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_663
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>S</span>Je ſprach: ›mvter, ich getrawe dir
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_664" id="v_664" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_664">v_664
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_664
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ minem vater her zv mir
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_665" id="v_665" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_665">v_665
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_665
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   aller der genaden wol,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_666" id="v_666" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_666">v_666
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_666
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der vater vn̄ mvter ſol
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_667" id="v_667" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_667">v_667
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_667
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Leiſten einem kinde,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_668" id="v_668" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_668">v_668
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_668
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als ich daz wol ervinde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_669" id="v_669" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_669">v_669
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_669
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von vͤch beiden aller tegelich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_670" id="v_670" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_670">v_670
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_670
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von gotes genaden habe ich
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_671" id="v_671" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_671">v_671
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_671
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sele vnde einen ſchonen lip.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_672" id="v_672" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_672">v_672
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_672
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mich lobet man vnde wip
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_673" id="v_673" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_673">v_673
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_673
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd alle, die mich ſehende ſint,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_674" id="v_674" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_674">v_674
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_674
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich ſi daz ſchonſte kint,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_675" id="v_675" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_675">v_675
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_675
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie ie haben geſehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_676" id="v_676" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_676">v_676
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_676
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wem ſol ich der genaden iehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_677" id="v_677" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_677">v_677
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_677
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wan vch beiden, nehſt gote?
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_678" id="v_678" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_678">v_678
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_678
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil vz ſinem gebote
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_815" id="v_815" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_815">v_815
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_815
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nimmer kvmen, wil iz got,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_816" id="v_816" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_816">v_816
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_816
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan iz iſt ſelber ſin gebot.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_817" id="v_817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_817">v_817
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_817
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_818" id="v_818" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_818">v_818
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_818
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_819" id="v_819" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_819">v_819
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_819
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch dvlde iz ane reͮwe.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_820" id="v_820" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_820">v_820
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_820
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil ovch miner treͮwe
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_821" id="v_821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_821">v_821
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_821
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   An mir ſelben niht vergezzen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_822" id="v_822" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_822">v_822
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_822
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz iſt alſo gemezzen,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_823" id="v_823" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_823">v_823
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_823
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swer einen ſo gevrevt hat,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_824" id="v_824" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_824">v_824
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_824
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ſelbe vnvro ſtat,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_825" id="v_825" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_825">v_825
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_825
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er einen andern kronet
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_826" id="v_826" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_826">v_826
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_826
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ſich ſelben honet,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_827" id="v_827" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_827">v_827
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_827
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der treͮwe, der ſi gar ze vil.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_828" id="v_828" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_828">v_828
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_828
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dvrch rechte ich vch des volgen wil,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_829" id="v_829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_829">v_829
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_829
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich vch treͮwe leiſte;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_830" id="v_830" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_830">v_830
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_830
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd mir ſelben aller meiſte.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_679" id="v_679" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_679">v_679
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_679
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_680" id="v_680" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_680">v_680
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_680
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_681" id="v_681" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_681">v_681
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_681
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mvter, vil ſeliges wip,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_682" id="v_682" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_682">v_682
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_682
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv ich ſele vn̄ lip
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_683" id="v_683" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_683">v_683
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_683
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von ewer zweier genaden han,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_684" id="v_684" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_684">v_684
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_684
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   lat mich in gotes hvlden ſtan,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_685" id="v_685" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_685">v_685
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_685
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich ſie mvͤzze beide
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_686" id="v_686" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_686">v_686
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_686
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von dem tevfel ſcheiden
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_687" id="v_687" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_687">v_687
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_687
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ſie zv himel mvͤzze geben.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_688" id="v_688" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_688">v_688
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_688
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dirre kranken werlde leben,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_689" id="v_689" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_689">v_689
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_689
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz iſt der ſele verluſt!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_690" id="v_690" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_690">v_690
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_690
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ja nv hat mich der gelvſt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_691" id="v_691" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_691">v_691
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_691
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Noch niht bervret,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_692" id="v_692" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_692">v_692
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_692
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der zv der helle fvret.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_693" id="v_693" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_693">v_693
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_693
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des wil ich got genade ſagen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_694" id="v_694" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_694">v_694
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_694
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er mir in minen Jvngen tagen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_695" id="v_695" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_695">v_695
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_695
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wol die witze hat gegeben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_696" id="v_696" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_696">v_696
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_696
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich vf ditz brode leben
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_697" id="v_697" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_697">v_697
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_697
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Achte harte kleine.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_698" id="v_698" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_698">v_698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_698
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil mich alſuſt reine
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_699" id="v_699" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_699">v_699
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_699
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   antworten in gotes gewalt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_700" id="v_700" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_700">v_700
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_700
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch fvrchte, vn̄ wurde ich alt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_701" id="v_701" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_701">v_701
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_701
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz mich der werlde ſvͤzze
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_702" id="v_702" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_702">v_702
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_702
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gezvckete vnder die fvͤzze,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_703" id="v_703" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_703">v_703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_703
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als ſie vil manigen hat gezogen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_704" id="v_704" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_704">v_704
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_704
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der zv der helle wirt betrogen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_705" id="v_705" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_705">v_705
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_705
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So wurde ich lichte gote entſait.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_706" id="v_706" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_706">v_706
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_706
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   den mvz ez immer ſin geklait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_707" id="v_707" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_707">v_707
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_707
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich biz morgen leben ſol.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_708" id="v_708" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_708">v_708
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_708
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   diſe werlt gevellet mir niht wol,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_708a" id="v_708a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_708a">v_708a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_708a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr gemach iſt michel arbeit,                  
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_709" id="v_709" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_709">v_709
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_709
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   jr maiſtez liep ein herzenleit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_710" id="v_710" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_710">v_710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_710
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_711" id="v_711" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_711">v_711
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_711
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr ſvͤzzes lon ein bitter not,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_712" id="v_712" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_712">v_712
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_712
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr lank leben iſt der gehe tot.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_713" id="v_713" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_713">v_713
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_713
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv enhabe wir niht gewizzes me,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_714" id="v_714" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_714">v_714
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_714
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   danne hevte wol vn̄ morgen we
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_715" id="v_715" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_715">v_715
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_715
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd doch ze Jvngeſt tot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_716" id="v_716" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_716">v_716
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_716
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mvter, daz iſt ein groze not!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_717" id="v_717" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_717">v_717
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_717
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv enſtet gebvrt vnd noch daz gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_718" id="v_718" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_718">v_718
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_718
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſchone, ſterke, wiſer mvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_719" id="v_719" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_719">v_719
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_719
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv enfvret tvgent vnd ere<span class="editorial_note">Seltener Fall einer Variante von Bb gegenüber Ba. enfvret, wohl zu swV vuoren gehörend, bedeutet ‘unterhalten, nähren, speisen’, hier natürlich im übertragenen
      Sinne</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_720" id="v_720" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_720">v_720
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_720
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vor den tot niht mere.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_721" id="v_721" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_721">v_721
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_721
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Din vngebvrt vn̄ vntvgent,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_722" id="v_722" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_722">v_722
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_722
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer leben vnd vnſer Jvgent,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_723" id="v_723" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_723">v_723
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_723
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz iſt ein leben vnd iſt ein ſtovp;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_724" id="v_724" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_724">v_724
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_724
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer ſtete bibet als ein lovp,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_726" id="v_726" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_726">v_726
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_726
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wir ſin ein nebel vnd ein rovch.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_725" id="v_725" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_725">v_725
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_725
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er iſt ein verſchaffener govch,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_727" id="v_727" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_727">v_727
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_727
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz ſi wip oder man,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_728" id="v_728" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_728">v_728
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_728
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   desder ſich derdes niht verſinnen kan
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_729" id="v_729" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_729">v_729
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_729
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd dirre werlde volgende iſt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_730" id="v_730" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_730">v_730
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_730
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ja iſt vns vber den fvlen miſt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_731" id="v_731" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_731">v_731
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_731
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der pfellel gebreitet;
