<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_732" id="v_732" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_732">v_732
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_732
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſwen der blik verleitet,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_733" id="v_733" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_733">v_733
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_733
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der iſt zv der helle geborn
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_734" id="v_734" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_734">v_734
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_734
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ enhat anders niht verlorn,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_735" id="v_735" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_735">v_735
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_735
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan die ſele vnd den lip.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_736" id="v_736" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_736">v_736
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_736
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mvter, vil ſeliges wip,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_737" id="v_737" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_737">v_737
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_737
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ge denket an mvterliche treͮwe
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_738" id="v_738" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_738">v_738
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_738
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ſenftet iwer reͮwe,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_739" id="v_739" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_739">v_739
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_739
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die ir habt vmme mich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_740" id="v_740" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_740">v_740
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_740
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo ver ſinnet ovch <span class="del">ſin</span><span class="del">min</span> vater ſich;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_742" id="v_742" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_742">v_742
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_742
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der iſt ein alſo wiſe man,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_741" id="v_741" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_741">v_741
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_741
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er ſelden vil wol gan.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_743" id="v_743" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_743">v_743
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_743
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv wizzet ir wol, daz ir
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_744" id="v_744" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_744">v_744
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_744
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ewer vrevde mit mir
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_745" id="v_745" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_745">v_745
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_745
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nicht lenger mvget gehan,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_746" id="v_746" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_746">v_746
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_746
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ob ich lebendic beſtan
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_747" id="v_747" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_747">v_747
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_747
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ein wenic lenger bi ev,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_748" id="v_748" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_748">v_748
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_748
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zwei iar oder drev,
