<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_749" id="v_749" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_749">v_749
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_749
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So iſt min lieber herre tot;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_750" id="v_750" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_750">v_750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_750
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo kvme wir in ſo groze not,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_751" id="v_751" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_751">v_751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_751
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz vns beſwert wirt der mvt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_752" id="v_752" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_752">v_752
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_752
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd daz ir dan ſo groz gvt
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_753" id="v_753" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_753">v_753
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_753
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit mir niht mvget gegeben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_754" id="v_754" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_754">v_754
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_754
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jchn mvͤzze lichte wirs leben,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_755" id="v_755" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_755">v_755
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_755
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz vch lieber wer·, were ich tot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_756" id="v_756" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_756">v_756
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_756
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv ſwige wir dirre grozen not,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_757" id="v_757" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_757">v_757
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_757
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz die vns icht werre ſere
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_758" id="v_758" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_758">v_758
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_758
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd vnſ min lieber herre
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_759" id="v_759" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_759">v_759
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_759
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo lange mvz leben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_760" id="v_760" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_760">v_760
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_760
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir mich einem manne mvget<span class="lb">|</span>geben,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_761" id="v_761" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_761">v_761
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_761
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der mir ſi rich vn̄ wert,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_762" id="v_762" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_762">v_762
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_762
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo iſt geſchehen, des ir beide gert;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_763" id="v_763" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_763">v_763
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_763
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So went ir, mir ſi wol geſchehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_764" id="v_764" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_764">v_764
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_764
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   anders hat mir min mvt ver iehen:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_765" id="v_765" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_765">v_765
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_765
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wirt er mir liep, daz iſt ein not,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_766" id="v_766" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_766">v_766
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_766
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wirt er mir leit, daz iſt der tot.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_767" id="v_767" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_767">v_767
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_767
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So han ich immer mere leit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_768" id="v_768" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_768">v_768
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_768
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd bin mit mancher arbeit
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_769" id="v_769" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_769">v_769
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_769
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Geſcheiden von gemache
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_770" id="v_770" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_770">v_770
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_770
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde lebe in ſvlche<span class="del">m</span><span class="del">n</span>ſulcher ſache,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_771" id="v_771" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_771">v_771
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_771
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz mancher vrowen wirret
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_772" id="v_772" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_772">v_772
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_772
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ ſie an vrevden irret.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_772a" id="v_772a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_772a">v_772a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_772a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv bin ich vch vil trevte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_772b" id="v_772b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_772b">v_772b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_772b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vil ſeligen levte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_772c" id="v_772c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_772c">v_772c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_772c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz keret mir zv gvte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_772d" id="v_772d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_772d">v_772d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_772d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ gevart nach minem mvte,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_773" id="v_773" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_773">v_773
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_773
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Setzet mich in den vollen rat,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_774" id="v_774" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_774">v_774
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_774
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der da nimmer zergat.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_775" id="v_775" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_775">v_775
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_775
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Min gert ein richer bovman,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_776" id="v_776" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_776">v_776
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_776
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dem ich mines libes gan.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_777" id="v_777" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_777">v_777
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_777
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zwar dem ſchvlt ir mich geben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_778" id="v_778" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_778">v_778
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_778
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo iſt wol beſtat min leben.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_779" id="v_779" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_779">v_779
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_779
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des pflvk get eben vn̄ wol,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_780" id="v_780" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_780">v_780
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_780
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſin hof iſt allez rates vol,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_781" id="v_781" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_781">v_781
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_781
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Donen mvet ros noch die rint,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_782" id="v_782" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_782">v_782
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_782
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Noch die weinenden kint,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_783" id="v_783" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_783">v_783
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_783
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den iſt ze heiz noch ze kalt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_784" id="v_784" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_784">v_784
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_784
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   donen wirt der iare nieman alt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_785" id="v_785" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_785">v_785
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_785
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der alt iſt, der wirt Jvnger,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_786" id="v_786" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_786">v_786
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_786
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   donen iſt weder dvrſt noch hvnger,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_786a" id="v_786a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_786a">v_786a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_786a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Done iſt weder haz noch nit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_786b" id="v_786b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_786b">v_786b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_786b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nicht wan maẏen weter zaller zit,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_788" id="v_788" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_788">v_788
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_788
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Donen iſt keiner ſlahte arbeit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_787" id="v_787" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_787">v_787
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_787
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Niht wan groze liebe ane leit.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_789" id="v_789" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_789">v_789
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_789
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv dem wil ich mich zi<span class="del">e</span>henzihenziehen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_790" id="v_790" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_790">v_790
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_790
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde wil den bov vliehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_791" id="v_791" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_791">v_791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_791
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den der ſchver vnd der hagel ſleht
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_792" id="v_792" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_792">v_792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_792
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd der wak abe tweht,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_793" id="v_793" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_793">v_793
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_793
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swaz der man ie geranc.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_794" id="v_794" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_794">v_794
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_794
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz iar, daz iſt in ſo lanc,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_795" id="v_795" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_795">v_795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_795
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz er ge arbeiten mac,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_796" id="v_796" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_796">v_796
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_796
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz nimet vil lihte ein halber tak.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_797" id="v_797" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_797">v_797
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_797
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den bov, den wil ich lazen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_798" id="v_798" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_798">v_798
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_798
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der ſi von mir ver wazen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_799" id="v_799" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_799">v_799
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_799
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_800" id="v_800" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_800">v_800
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_800
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_801" id="v_801" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_801">v_801
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_801
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_802" id="v_802" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_802">v_802
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_802
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_803" id="v_803" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_803">v_803
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_803
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_804" id="v_804" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_804">v_804
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_804
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_805" id="v_805" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_805">v_805
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_805
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_806" id="v_806" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_806">v_806
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_806
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil mich halden
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_806a" id="v_806a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_806a">v_806a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_806a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ wil er balden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_807" id="v_807" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_807">v_807
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_807
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   An vnſern herren Jeſvm criſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_808" id="v_808" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_808">v_808
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_808
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des genade alſo ſtete iſt,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_809" id="v_809" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_809">v_809
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_809
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie nimmer zer gat
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_810" id="v_810" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_810">v_810
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_810
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd daz er zv mir armen hat
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_811" id="v_811" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_811">v_811
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_811
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Alſo gvte minne,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_812" id="v_812" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_812">v_812
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_812
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo zv einer kvneginne.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_813" id="v_813" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_813">v_813
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_813
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_814" id="v_814" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_814">v_814
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_814
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_831" id="v_831" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_831">v_831
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_831
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wolt ir erwenden mir min heil,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_832" id="v_832" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_832">v_832
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_832
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zwar, ich laz vch ein teil
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_833" id="v_833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_833">v_833
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_833
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   E nach mir weinen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_834" id="v_834" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_834">v_834
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_834
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil mir beſcheinen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_835" id="v_835" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_835">v_835
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_835
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des ich mir ſelber ſchvldic bin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_836" id="v_836" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_836">v_836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_836
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zwar ich wil <span class="del">h</span>iehieie dar hin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_837" id="v_837" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_837">v_837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_837
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ich volle vrevde vinde.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_838" id="v_838" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_838">v_838
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_838
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr habet noch mer kinde –
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_839" id="v_839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_839">v_839
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_839
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die lazet iwer vrevde ſin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_840" id="v_840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_840">v_840
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_840
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dvrch got, getroſtet vch min
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_840a" id="v_840a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_840a">v_840a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_840a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der kvrtzen vriſt vnd der z<span class="del">e</span>itzitzeit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_840b" id="v_840b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_840b">v_840b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_840b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die alſo ſchire gel<span class="del">e</span>itgelitgeleit.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_852c" id="v_852c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_852c">v_852c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_852c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Morgen hilfet vns min got
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_852d" id="v_852d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_852d">v_852d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_852d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vz von allerſlahte not.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_853" id="v_853" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_853">v_853
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_853
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des todes geneſe wir,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_854" id="v_854" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_854">v_854
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_854
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ich verre baz dan ir.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_841" id="v_841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_841">v_841
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_841
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn kan mir nieman erwern,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_842" id="v_842" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_842">v_842
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_842
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch enwelle wol ernern
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_843" id="v_843" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_843">v_843
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_843
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Minen herren vnde mich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_844" id="v_844" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_844">v_844
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_844
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mvter, ich horte dich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_845" id="v_845" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_845">v_845
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_845
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Klagen vnde ſprechen e|,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_846" id="v_846" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_846">v_846
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_846
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Js tete dinem herzen we,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_847" id="v_847" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_847">v_847
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_847
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Soldeſt dv ob minem grabe ſtan;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_848" id="v_848" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_848">v_848
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_848
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dv wirdeſt ſin vil wol erlan:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_849" id="v_849" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_849">v_849
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_849
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dv ſteſt ob minem grabe niht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_850" id="v_850" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_850">v_850
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_850
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dort, do mir der tot geſchiht,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_851" id="v_851" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_851">v_851
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_851
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz enlet dich nieman ſehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_852" id="v_852" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_852">v_852
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_852
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Js ſchol zv ſalerne geſchehen.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_852a" id="v_852a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_852a">v_852a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_852a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_852b" id="v_852b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_852b">v_852b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_852b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_855" id="v_855" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_855">v_855
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_855
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ſie daz kint ſahen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_856" id="v_856" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_856">v_856
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_856
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nach dem tode alſo gahen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_857" id="v_857" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_857">v_857
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_857
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz is ſo wizzelichen ſprach
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_858" id="v_858" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_858">v_858
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_858
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd menſchliche recht brach,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_859" id="v_859" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_859">v_859
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_859
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie begonden achten vnder in,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_860" id="v_860" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_860">v_860
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_860
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz den wiſtvm vnd den ſin
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_861" id="v_861" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_861">v_861
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_861
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nicht vol brengen kvnde
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_862" id="v_862" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_862">v_862
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_862
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   deheine zvnge in kindes mvnde.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_863" id="v_863" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_863">v_863
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_863
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie iahen, daz der heilige geiſt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_864" id="v_864" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_864">v_864
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_864
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   were der rede volleiſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_865" id="v_865" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_865">v_865
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_865
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der ovch ſente Niclavs pflac,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_866" id="v_866" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_866">v_866
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_866
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do er in ſiner wigen lac
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_867" id="v_867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_867">v_867
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_867
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde in die wiſheit larte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_868" id="v_868" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_868">v_868
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_868
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er zv gote karte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_869" id="v_869" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_869">v_869
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_869
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sin kintlich gemvte.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_870" id="v_870" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_870">v_870
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_870
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie bedachten ſich in irre gvte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_871" id="v_871" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_871">v_871
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_871
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie niht enwolden
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_872" id="v_872" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_872">v_872
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_872
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Noch weren enſcholden,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_873" id="v_873" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_873">v_873
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_873
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie ſich hatte ane genvmen;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_874" id="v_874" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_874">v_874
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_874
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr were der ſinne noch von gote kvm̄.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_875" id="v_875" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_875">v_875
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_875
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vor iamer erkalte in der lip,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_876" id="v_876" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_876">v_876
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_876
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz der meẏer vnd ſin wip
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_877" id="v_877" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_877">v_877
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_877
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn dem bette ſazen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_878" id="v_878" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_878">v_878
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_878
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo, daz ſie vergazen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_880" id="v_880" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_880">v_880
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_880
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der zvngen vnd der ſinne,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_879" id="v_879" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_879">v_879
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_879
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dvrch des kindes minne,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_881" id="v_881" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_881">v_881
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_881
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an den ſelben ſtvnden,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_882" id="v_882" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_882">v_882
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_882
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo daz ſie enkvnden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_883" id="v_883" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_883">v_883
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_883
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ein wort niht geſprechen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_884" id="v_884" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_884">v_884
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_884
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die giht begonde brechen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_885" id="v_885" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_885">v_885
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_885
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die mvter vor leide.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_886" id="v_886" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_886">v_886
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_886
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do satzten ſie <span class="del">ſich</span> beide
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_887" id="v_887" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_887">v_887
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_887
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_888" id="v_888" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_888">v_888
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_888
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_889" id="v_889" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_889">v_889
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_889
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ dachten, waz in tochte.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_890" id="v_890" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_890">v_890
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_890
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv ir nieman enmohte
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_891" id="v_891" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_891">v_891
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_891
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er weren irn willen vn̄ iren mvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_892" id="v_892" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_892">v_892
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_892
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn were niht alſo gvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_893" id="v_893" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_893">v_893
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_893
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So daz ſie is ir l gvnden,<span class="editorial_note">Wieder steht in der Handschrift ein Ansatz zu einem falschem Buchstaben, ein Tilgungszeichen
      fehlt</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_894" id="v_894" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_894">v_894
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_894
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wannen ſie enkvnden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_895" id="v_895" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_895">v_895
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_895
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr nimmer werden ane baz.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_896" id="v_896" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_896">v_896
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_896
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ge viengen ſie der rede haz,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_897" id="v_897" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_897">v_897
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_897
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz mohte in an irem herren
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_898" id="v_898" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_898">v_898
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_898
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gewerren harte ſere,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_899" id="v_899" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_899">v_899
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_899
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ gewunnen anders niht da mit.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_900" id="v_900" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_900">v_900
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_900
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan mit williclichem ſit
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_901" id="v_901" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_901">v_901
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_901
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jahen ſie beide do,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_902" id="v_902" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_902">v_902
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_902
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie der rede weren vro,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_902a" id="v_902a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_902a">v_902a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_902a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd daz is ſie dovchte in irem mvt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_902b" id="v_902b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_902b">v_902b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_902b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vil getrevlichen gvt.
   <br></span>





<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_903" id="v_903" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_903">v_903
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_903
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des vrevte ſich die ſchone mait.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_904" id="v_904" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_904">v_904
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_904
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do is ein wenic was betait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_905" id="v_905" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_905">v_905
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_905
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do gienc ſie, do ir herre ſlief;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_906" id="v_906" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_906">v_906
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_906
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sin gemale im do rief:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_907" id="v_907" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_907">v_907
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_907
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Lieber herre, ſlafet ir?‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_908" id="v_908" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_908">v_908
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_908
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›nein, gemale, waz wirret dir?
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_909" id="v_909" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_909">v_909
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_909
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wie biſt dv hevte alſo frv?‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_910" id="v_910" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_910">v_910
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_910
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie ſprach: ›do twinget mich dar zv
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_911" id="v_911" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_911">v_911
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_911
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz iamer euwer ſiecheit.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_912" id="v_912" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_912">v_912
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_912
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›daz weiz ich wol, daz iſt dir leit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_913" id="v_913" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_913">v_913
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_913
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz haſt dv an mir erzeiget wol,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_914" id="v_914" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_914">v_914
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_914
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Als dir got iz vergelten ſol.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_915" id="v_915" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_915">v_915
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_915
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nvnen mac ez rat niht geſin.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_916" id="v_916" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_916">v_916
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_916
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Trowen, lieber herre min,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_917" id="v_917" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_917">v_917
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_917
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des ſol werden vil gvt rat,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_918" id="v_918" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_918">v_918
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_918
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſint iwer dinc alſo ſtat,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_919" id="v_919" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_919">v_919
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_919
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich vch gehelfen mac,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_920" id="v_920" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_920">v_920
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_920
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch enſovmes nimmer tac.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_921" id="v_921" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_921">v_921
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_921
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr habet vns alſo geſait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_922" id="v_922" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_922">v_922
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_922
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ob ir hettet eine mait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_923" id="v_923" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_923">v_923
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_923
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die den tot gerne lite,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_924" id="v_924" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_924">v_924
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_924
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do geneſet ir mite.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_925" id="v_925" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_925">v_925
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_925
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die wil ich ſelber gerne ſin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_926" id="v_926" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_926">v_926
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_926
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jwer leben iſt nvtzer den daz min.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_926a" id="v_926a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_926a">v_926a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_926a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Got mvͤz iz ſin geklait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_926b" id="v_926b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_926b">v_926b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_926b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir is ſo lange habt verdait.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_926c" id="v_926c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_926c">v_926c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_926c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wer is mir vor drin iaren kvnt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_926d" id="v_926d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_926d">v_926d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_926d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr weret nv wol geſvnt.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_927" id="v_927" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_927">v_927
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_927
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do genadet ir der herre
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_928" id="v_928" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_928">v_928
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_928
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des willen alſo ſere.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_929" id="v_929" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_929">v_929
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_929
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_930" id="v_930" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_930">v_930
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_930
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_931" id="v_931" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_931">v_931
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_931
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ſprach: ›gemale, ia en iſt der tot
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_932" id="v_932" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_932">v_932
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_932
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   niht ein alſo ſenfte not,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_933" id="v_933" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_933">v_933
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_933
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Als dv dir haſt erdaht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_934" id="v_934" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_934">v_934
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_934
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dv haſt mich des wol innen braht:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_935" id="v_935" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_935">v_935
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_935
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mochtes dv, | dv hvlfeſt mir.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_936" id="v_936" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_936">v_936
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_936
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des genvget mir von dir.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_937" id="v_937" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_937">v_937
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_937
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_938" id="v_938" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_938">v_938
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_938
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_939" id="v_939" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_939">v_939
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_939
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jchn ſol an dich niht gern,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_940" id="v_940" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_940">v_940
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_940
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dv macht mich, vrowe, niht ernern.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_941" id="v_941" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_941">v_941
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_941
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz dv nv geſprochen haſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_942" id="v_942" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_942">v_942
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_942
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der treͮwe, der dv an mir begaſt,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_943" id="v_943" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_943">v_943
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_943
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der vergelt dir got.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_944" id="v_944" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_944">v_944
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_944
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Js were der lantlevte ſpot,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_945" id="v_945" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_945">v_945
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_945
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich mich nach dirre ſtvnde
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_946" id="v_946" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_946">v_946
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_946
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der artztie vnder wunde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_947" id="v_947" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_947">v_947
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_947
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ mich daz niht vervienge,
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_948" id="v_948" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_948">v_948
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_948
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als is vil lichte ergienge.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_949" id="v_949" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_949">v_949
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_949
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dv tvſt als die kint,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_950" id="v_950" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_950">v_950
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_950
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die gehes gemvtes ſint:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_951" id="v_951" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_951">v_951
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_951
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swaz in kvmet in den mvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_952" id="v_952" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_952">v_952
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_952
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz ſei vbel oder gvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_953" id="v_953" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_953">v_953
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_953
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dar zv wirt in vil gach
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_954" id="v_954" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_954">v_954
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_954
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ gerewet ſie dar nach.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_955" id="v_955" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_955">v_955
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_955
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gemale, alſo tvſt dv:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_956" id="v_956" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_956">v_956
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_956
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz were dir zv mvte nv,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_957" id="v_957" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_957">v_957
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_957
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der is von dir nemen wolde,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_958" id="v_958" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_958">v_958
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_958
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als man iz wol enden ſolde,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_959" id="v_959" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_959">v_959
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_959
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So gereͮwe ez dich doch.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_960" id="v_960" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_960">v_960
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_960
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie ſich noch
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_961" id="v_961" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_961">v_961
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_961
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   be dechte, des bat er.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_962" id="v_962" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_962">v_962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_962
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›din mvter vnd din vater,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_963" id="v_963" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_963">v_963
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_963
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die mvgen din, vrowe, niht enpern.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_964" id="v_964" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_964">v_964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_964
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jchn wil ires leides niht gern,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_965" id="v_965" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_965">v_965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_965
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie mir ie genaden taten.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_966" id="v_966" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_966">v_966
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_966
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie dir beide raten,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_967" id="v_967" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_967">v_967
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_967
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Liebes kint, des volge dv.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_968" id="v_968" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_968">v_968
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_968
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do lachte er nv zv,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_969" id="v_969" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_969">v_969
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_969
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan er ſich wenic des verſach,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_970" id="v_970" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_970">v_970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_970
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz im ſint da von geſchach.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_971" id="v_971" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_971">v_971
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_971
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_972" id="v_972" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_972">v_972
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_972
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr vater vnd ir mvter ie,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_972a" id="v_972a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_972a">v_972a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_972a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ſprachen beidentſamt hie:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_973" id="v_973" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_973">v_973
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_973
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Treͮwen, lieber herre,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_974" id="v_974" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_974">v_974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_974
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr habet vns vil ſere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_975" id="v_975" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_975">v_975
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_975
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ge liebet vnde geeret;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_976" id="v_976" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_976">v_976
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_976
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn were niht wol verkeret,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_977" id="v_977" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_977">v_977
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_977
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wirn lontens evch mit gvte.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_978" id="v_978" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_978">v_978
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_978
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnſer tochter iſt des ze mvte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_979" id="v_979" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_979">v_979
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_979
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie den tot dvrch vch dole.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_980" id="v_980" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_980">v_980
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_980
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv gvnne wirs vch wole,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_980a" id="v_980a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_980a">v_980a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_980a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wir haben ſie dar vmbe her bracht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_980b" id="v_980b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_980b">v_980b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_980b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie enhat ſich kvrtze niht bedaht:
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_981" id="v_981" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_981">v_981
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_981
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz iſt hevte der dritte tak,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_982" id="v_982" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_982">v_982
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_982
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie vns alles an lak,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_983" id="v_983" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_983">v_983
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_983
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz wir is ir gvnden;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_984" id="v_984" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_984">v_984
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_984
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv hat ſie <span class="del">vr</span> is an vns fvnden.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_985" id="v_985" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_985">v_985
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_985
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Got laz vch mit ir geneſen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_986" id="v_986" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_986">v_986
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_986
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wir wollen ir dvrch vch entweſen.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_987" id="v_987" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_987">v_987
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_987
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>O nv ſin gemale bot
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_988" id="v_988" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_988">v_988
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_988
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   fvr ſinen ſiechtvm iren tot,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_989" id="v_989" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_989">v_989
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_989
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er irn rechten ernſt ſach,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_990" id="v_990" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_990">v_990
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_990
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do wart michel vngemach,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_991" id="v_991" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_991">v_991
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_991
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Reuwiclich gebere
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_992" id="v_992" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_992">v_992
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_992
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde miſliche ſwere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_993" id="v_993" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_993">v_993
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_993
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do begvnde ſich heben vnder in,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_994" id="v_994" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_994">v_994
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_994
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zwiſchen dem kinde vn̄ den drin.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_995" id="v_995" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_995">v_995
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_995
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_996" id="v_996" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_996">v_996
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_996
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_997" id="v_997" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_997">v_997
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_997
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_998" id="v_998" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_998">v_998
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_998
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_999" id="v_999" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_999">v_999
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_999
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do begonde ovch der herre
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1000" id="v_1000" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1000">v_1000
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1000
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv denken alſo ſere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1001" id="v_1001" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1001">v_1001
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1001
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an des kindes treͮwe<span class="del">n</span>treͮwentreͮwe.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1002" id="v_1002" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1002">v_1002
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1002
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn begreif ein ſvlche reͮwe,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1002a" id="v_1002a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1002a">v_1002a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1002a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er ſie drvkte an ſine brvͤſte.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1002b" id="v_1002b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1002b">v_1002b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1002b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ſie niht enkvſte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1002c" id="v_1002c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1002c">v_1002c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1002c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz liez er dvrch ſin ſiecheit.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1002d" id="v_1002d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1002d">v_1002d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1002d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar nach begreif in ein ſvͤzez leit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1003" id="v_1003" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1003">v_1003
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1003
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er zwifeln began,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1004" id="v_1004" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1004">v_1004
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1004
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1005" id="v_1005" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1005">v_1005
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1005
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   weder im were beſſer gelan od ͛ getan.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1006" id="v_1006" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1006">v_1006
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1006
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1007" id="v_1007" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1007">v_1007
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1007
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1008" id="v_1008" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1008">v_1008
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1008
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1009" id="v_1009" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1009">v_1009
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1009
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1010" id="v_1010" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1010">v_1010
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1010
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1011" id="v_1011" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1011">v_1011
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1011
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv Jvngeſt do bedachte ſich
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1012" id="v_1012" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1012">v_1012
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1012
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr herre, der arme heinrich,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1013" id="v_1013" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1013">v_1013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1013
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde begonde ſagen vnder in:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1014" id="v_1014" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1014">v_1014
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1014
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   groze genade in allen drin
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1015" id="v_1015" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1015">v_1015
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1015
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der trewe vnd des gvtes.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1016" id="v_1016" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1016">v_1016
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1016
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die mait wart riches mvtes,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1017" id="v_1017" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1017">v_1017
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1017
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er ir volgte gerne.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1018" id="v_1018" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1018">v_1018
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1018
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie bereiten ſich gein Salerne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1019" id="v_1019" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1019">v_1019
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1019
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So ſie aller baldeſt mohten.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1020" id="v_1020" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1020">v_1020
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1020
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz der meide wol an tohte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1021" id="v_1021" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1021">v_1021
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1021
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz was ſchire bereit:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1022" id="v_1022" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1022">v_1022
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1022
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beide pfert vnde kleit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1023" id="v_1023" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1023">v_1023
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1023
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie nie getrvc vor der zit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1024" id="v_1024" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1024">v_1024
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1024
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hermel vnde ſamit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1025" id="v_1025" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1025">v_1025
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1025
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Den beſten zobel, den man vant,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1026" id="v_1026" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1026">v_1026
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1026
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der was der meide gewant.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1026a" id="v_1026a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1026a">v_1026a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1026a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie ſchein ſo ſchne in ſwacher wat,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1026b" id="v_1026b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1026b">v_1026b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1026b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie nv gar ze wunſche ſtat.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1027" id="v_1027" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1027">v_1027
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1027
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv enkonde vch nieman vollen ſagē
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1028" id="v_1028" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1028">v_1028
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1028
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jres herzen rewe vnd ovch ir klagē.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1029" id="v_1029" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1029">v_1029
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1029
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der mvter grimmigez leit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1030" id="v_1030" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1030">v_1030
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1030
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ovch des vater arbeit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1031" id="v_1031" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1031">v_1031
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1031
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1032" id="v_1032" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1032">v_1032
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1032
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1033" id="v_1033" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1033">v_1033
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1033
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ſie ir liebes kint von in
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1034" id="v_1034" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1034">v_1034
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1034
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   fvrten ſo geſvndes hin
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1035" id="v_1035" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1035">v_1035
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1035
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn einen ſo gewiſlichen tot,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1036" id="v_1036" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1036">v_1036
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1036
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan daz in ſenfte diſe not
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1037" id="v_1037" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1037">v_1037
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1037
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die reine gotes gvͤte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1038" id="v_1038" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1038">v_1038
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1038
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   da von ovch daz gemvͤte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1039" id="v_1039" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1039">v_1039
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1039
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dem kleinen kinde beqvam,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1040" id="v_1040" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1040">v_1040
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1040
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz is den tot gerne nam.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1041" id="v_1041" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1041">v_1041
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1041
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz was vf iren rat bekvmen;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1042" id="v_1042" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1042">v_1042
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1042
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hie mite ſo was in benvmen
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1043" id="v_1043" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1043">v_1043
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1043
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mancher hande ſwere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1044" id="v_1044" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1044">v_1044
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1044
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan iz anders wunder were,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1045" id="v_1045" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1045">v_1045
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1045
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ir herze niht ze brach.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1046" id="v_1046" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1046">v_1046
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1046
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ze liebe waſ in vngemach,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1047" id="v_1047" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1047">v_1047
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1047
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde enhatten keiner ſlahte not
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1048" id="v_1048" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1048">v_1048
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1048
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vmb ires lieben kindes tot.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1049" id="v_1049" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1049">v_1049
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1049
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>S</span>vſt fvr gegen Salerne
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1050" id="v_1050" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1050">v_1050
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1050
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vrolichen <span class="del">vn̄</span> gerne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1051" id="v_1051" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1051">v_1051
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1051
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die mait mit irem herren.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1052" id="v_1052" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1052">v_1052
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1052
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie kleite niht ſo ſere,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1053" id="v_1053" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1053">v_1053
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1053
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan daz der wek ſo lanc was,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054" id="v_1054" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054">v_1054
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ſie ſo lange genas.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054a" id="v_1054a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054a">v_1054a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er vf daz velt qvam vor die ſtat,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054b" id="v_1054b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054b">v_1054b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   got er innenklichen bat,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054c" id="v_1054c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054c">v_1054c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſin reiſe were bewant,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054d" id="v_1054d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054d">v_1054d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ein ſo wit lant
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054e" id="v_1054e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054e">v_1054e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hinder im mvſte lazen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054f" id="v_1054f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054f">v_1054f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des bat er got vf der ſtrazen;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054g" id="v_1054g" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054g">v_1054g
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054g
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Oder mit deheinen vneren
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054h" id="v_1054h" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054h">v_1054h
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054h
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ze lande mvſten keren.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054i" id="v_1054i" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054i">v_1054i
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054i
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des antwort im die ſchone mait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054j" id="v_1054j" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054j">v_1054j
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054j
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie ſprach: ›herre, iz iſt vch wol geſait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054k" id="v_1054k" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054k">v_1054k
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054k
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swer lip hat vnde gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054l" id="v_1054l" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054l">v_1054l
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054l
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der ſol ovch haben ſteten mvt
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054m" id="v_1054m" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054m">v_1054m
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054m
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ſol got vor ovgen han,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054n" id="v_1054n" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054n">v_1054n
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054n
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo enkan im nimmer miſſegan.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054o" id="v_1054o" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054o">v_1054o
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054o
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv tvt iz noch, des volget mir:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054p" id="v_1054p" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054p">v_1054p
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054p
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   lat ewer zwifeliche gir!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054q" id="v_1054q" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054q">v_1054q
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054q
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Got gibt vch wider ewern geſvnt;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1054r" id="v_1054r" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1054r">v_1054r
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1054r
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr gewinnet gvtes vollen grvnt.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1055" id="v_1055" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1055">v_1055
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1055
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>O er ſie do brachte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1056" id="v_1056" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1056">v_1056
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1056
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   da hin, do er gedahte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1057" id="v_1057" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1057">v_1057
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1057
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er ſinen meiſter vant,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1058" id="v_1058" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1058">v_1058
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1058
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do wart in alzehant
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1059" id="v_1059" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1059">v_1059
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1059
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   werlichen geſait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1060" id="v_1060" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1060">v_1060
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1060
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er hette bracht eine mait,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1061" id="v_1061" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1061">v_1061
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1061
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die er in gewinnen hiez;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1062" id="v_1062" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1062">v_1062
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1062
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar zv er ſie in ſehen liez.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1063" id="v_1063" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1063">v_1063
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1063
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz dovchte in gar vnbillich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1064" id="v_1064" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1064">v_1064
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1064
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er ſprach: ›kint, haſtu dich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1065" id="v_1065" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1065">v_1065
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1065
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Diſe rede ſelber an genvmen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1066" id="v_1066" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1066">v_1066
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1066
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder biſtu hie zv bekvmen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1067" id="v_1067" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1067">v_1067
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1067
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von dines herren dro?‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1068" id="v_1068" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1068">v_1068
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1068
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do antworte ſie im do,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1069" id="v_1069" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1069">v_1069
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1069
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie ſelber die rede
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1070" id="v_1070" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1070">v_1070
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1070
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von irem herzen hete.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1071" id="v_1071" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1071">v_1071
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1071
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des nam in michel wunder,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1072" id="v_1072" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1072">v_1072
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1072
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er wiſte ſie beſvnder
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1073" id="v_1073" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1073">v_1073
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1073
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hin danne alſo ſere
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1074" id="v_1074" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1074">v_1074
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1074
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde vragte, ob ſie ir herre
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1075" id="v_1075" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1075">v_1075
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1075
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die rede hete vz er drot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1076" id="v_1076" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1076">v_1076
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1076
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er ſprach: ›kint, dir iſt not,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1077" id="v_1077" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1077">v_1077
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1077
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz dv dich bedenkeſt baz.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1078" id="v_1078" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1078">v_1078
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1078
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch ſage dir rechte, vmbe waz:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1079" id="v_1079" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1079">v_1079
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1079
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie dv den tot liden mvſt,
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1080" id="v_1080" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1080">v_1080
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1080
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ob dv daz niht gerne tvſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1081" id="v_1081" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1081">v_1081
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1081
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So iſt din Jvnger lip tot
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1082" id="v_1082" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1082">v_1082
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1082
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd frvmet vnſ niht vmb ein brot.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1083" id="v_1083" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1083">v_1083
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1083
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv enhile ich mich dines willen niht!<span class="editorial_note">Wahrscheinlich hat der Schreiber versehentlich ich geschrieben, dann das mich nachgetragen und den Rest, wie bei ihm üblich, ungetilgt stehengelassen</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1084" id="v_1084" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1084">v_1084
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1084
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch sage dir, wie dir geſchiht:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1085" id="v_1085" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1085">v_1085
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1085
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch zihe dich vz, ſo ſteſt dv bloz,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1086" id="v_1086" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1086">v_1086
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1086
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo iſt din ſchame alſo groz,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1087" id="v_1087" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1087">v_1087
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1087
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die dv von ſchvlden danne haſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1088" id="v_1088" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1088">v_1088
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1088
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan dv nacket vor mir ſtaſt.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1089" id="v_1089" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1089">v_1089
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1089
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch binde dir bein vnde arm;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1090" id="v_1090" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1090">v_1090
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1090
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſich, ob dich din ſchoner lip erbarm.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1091" id="v_1091" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1091">v_1091
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1091
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch ſag dir dinen ſmerzen:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1092" id="v_1092" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1092">v_1092
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1092
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch ſnit dich gegen dem herzen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1093" id="v_1093" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1093">v_1093
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1093
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde breche iz lebendic von dir.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1094" id="v_1094" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1094">v_1094
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1094
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vrevwelin, nv ſage mir,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1095" id="v_1095" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1095">v_1095
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1095
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie din wille dar vmbe ſte.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1096" id="v_1096" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1096">v_1096
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1096
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn geſchach nie kinde ſo we,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1097" id="v_1097" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1097">v_1097
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1097
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Als dir von mir mvz geſchehen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1098" id="v_1098" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1098">v_1098
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1098
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich iz tvn ſol vn̄ ſehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1099" id="v_1099" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1099">v_1099
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1099
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do habe ich groze ſorge zv.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1100" id="v_1100" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1100">v_1100
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1100
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sich, wie iz dinem libe tv:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1101" id="v_1101" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1101">v_1101
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1101
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gerwet is dich hares breit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1102" id="v_1102" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1102">v_1102
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1102
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo habe wir alle vnſer arbeit
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1103" id="v_1103" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1103">v_1103
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1103
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd dv dinen lip verlorn .‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1104" id="v_1104" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1104">v_1104
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1104
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo wart ſie tevre beſworn,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1105" id="v_1105" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1105">v_1105
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1105
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie ſich erkente ſtete
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1106" id="v_1106" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1106">v_1106
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1106
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder ſich ſin abe tete.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1107" id="v_1107" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1107">v_1107
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1107
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>Es antworte im die ſchone mait,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1108" id="v_1108" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1108">v_1108
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1108
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1109" id="v_1109" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1109">v_1109
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1109
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1110" id="v_1110" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1110">v_1110
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1110
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1111" id="v_1111" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1111">v_1111
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1111
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1112" id="v_1112" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1112">v_1112
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1112
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1113" id="v_1113" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1113">v_1113
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1113
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1114" id="v_1114" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1114">v_1114
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1114
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie ſprach: ›ich bin ein lvtzel v͛zait.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1114a" id="v_1114a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1114a">v_1114a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1114a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1114b" id="v_1114b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1114b">v_1114b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1114b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1115" id="v_1115" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1115">v_1115
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1115
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1116" id="v_1116" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1116">v_1116
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1116
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1118" id="v_1118" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1118">v_1118
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1118
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   einen zwifel ich gewunnen han.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1117" id="v_1117" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1117">v_1117
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1117
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wizzet ir, wie der iſt getan?
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1119" id="v_1119" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1119">v_1119
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1119
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch fvrchte, daz vnſer arbeit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1120" id="v_1120" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1120">v_1120
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1120
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von eͮwer grozen zagenheit
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1121" id="v_1121" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1121">v_1121
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1121
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnder wegen belibe.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1122" id="v_1122" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1122">v_1122
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1122
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn zeme einem wibe,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1123" id="v_1123" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1123">v_1123
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1123
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr ſit eines haſen genoz!
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1124" id="v_1124" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1124">v_1124
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1124
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie iſt iwer angeſt ſo groz
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1125" id="v_1125" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1125">v_1125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1125
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vmb daz ich erſterben ſol.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1126" id="v_1126" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1126">v_1126
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1126
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zwar, ir handelt niht wol
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1127" id="v_1127" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1127">v_1127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1127
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jwer kvnſt vnd iwer meiſterſchaft!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1128" id="v_1128" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1128">v_1128
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1128
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch bin ein mait vnd han die kraft,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1129" id="v_1129" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1129">v_1129
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1129
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Tvrret ir mich ſniden,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130" id="v_1130" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130">v_1130
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch tar is wol erliden!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130a" id="v_1130a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130a">v_1130a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr ſagt mir vil von ſolcher not
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130b" id="v_1130b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130b">v_1130b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ wenet des, daz ich den tot 
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130c" id="v_1130c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130c">v_1130c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Deſter vorchtlicher lide.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130d" id="v_1130d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130d">v_1130d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do habt ir mir geliebet mite,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1157" id="v_1157" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1157">v_1157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1157
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ reitzet mich vaſte dar zv.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1158" id="v_1158" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1158">v_1158
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1158
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch weiz wol, dvrch wen ich is tv.
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1159" id="v_1159" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1159">v_1159
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1159
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn des namen iz geſchehen ſol,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1160" id="v_1160" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1160">v_1160
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1160
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der erkennet ſtarken dienſt wol;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1161" id="v_1161" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1161">v_1161
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1161
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er let ſin vngelonet niht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1162" id="v_1162" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1162">v_1162
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1162
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch weiz wol, wes got ſelbe giht:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1163" id="v_1163" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1163">v_1163
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1163
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Wer ſweren dienſt leiſte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1164" id="v_1164" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1164">v_1164
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1164
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der lon ſi aller meiſte
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130e" id="v_1130e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130e">v_1130e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>Jſen grimmiclichen tot
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1130f" id="v_1130f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1130f">v_1130f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1130f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde diſe engeſtliche not
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1131" id="v_1131" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1131">v_1131
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1131
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde diſe miſliche arbeit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1132" id="v_1132" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1132">v_1132
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1132
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ir mir vor habt geſeit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1133" id="v_1133" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1133">v_1133
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1133
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die hatte ich an vch wol vernvmen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1134" id="v_1134" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1134">v_1134
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1134
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jchn were niht anders her kvmen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1135" id="v_1135" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1135">v_1135
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1135
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan daz ich mich weſte
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1136" id="v_1136" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1136">v_1136
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1136
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an trewen alſo veſte,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1137" id="v_1137" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1137">v_1137
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1137
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich is wol dvlde.
   <br></span>
