         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1201
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So ſere er barmte ſie in,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1202" id="v_1202" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1202">v_1202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1202
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz im der mvt vnd der ſin
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1203" id="v_1203" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1203">v_1203
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1203
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an ir vil nach was verzait.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1204" id="v_1204" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1204">v_1204
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1204
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſach ovch die ſchone mait
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1205" id="v_1205" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1205">v_1205
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1205
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Einen tiſch bi ir ſtan,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1206" id="v_1206" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1206">v_1206
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1206
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do hiez er ſie vf gan.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1206a" id="v_1206a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1206a">v_1206a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1206a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der ſprvnc was hoch vn̄ lanc,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1206b" id="v_1206b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1206b">v_1206b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1206b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   den die mait vf den tiſch ſpranc.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1207" id="v_1207" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1207">v_1207
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1207
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dar vf er ſie vil vaſte bant.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1208" id="v_1208" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1208">v_1208
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1208
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do nam er in ſin hant
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1209" id="v_1209" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1209">v_1209
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1209
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ein meſſer, daz da bi lac,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1210" id="v_1210" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1210">v_1210
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1210
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des er zv ſvlchen dingen pflac.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1211" id="v_1211" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1211">v_1211
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1211
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz was ſcharf vnde breit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1212" id="v_1212" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1212">v_1212
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1212
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan daz is niht ſo wol enſneit,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1213" id="v_1213" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1213">v_1213
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1213
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als im liep were geweſen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1214" id="v_1214" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1214">v_1214
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1214
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſie niht lenger ſolde geneſen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1215" id="v_1215" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1215">v_1215
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1215
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er barmte in ir not,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1216" id="v_1216" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1216">v_1216
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1216
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er wolde ir ſanfte tvn den tot.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1217" id="v_1217" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1217">v_1217
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1217
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do lag ovch do bi ein
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1218" id="v_1218" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1218">v_1218
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1218
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo gvt wetzelſtein,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1219" id="v_1219" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1219">v_1219
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1219
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do begonde er an ſtrichen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1220" id="v_1220" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1220">v_1220
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1220
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo rechte mvzlichen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1221" id="v_1221" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1221">v_1221
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1221
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er daz ſtrichen er horte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1222" id="v_1222" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1222">v_1222
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1222
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſin vrevde gar verſtorte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1223" id="v_1223" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1223">v_1223
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1223
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der arme heinrich da vur.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1224" id="v_1224" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1224">v_1224
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1224
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er lac vzen bi der tvr
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1224a" id="v_1224a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1224a">v_1224a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1224a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ gedacht an des kindes treͮwe.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1224b" id="v_1224b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1224b">v_1224b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1224b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie begonde in ſere reͮwen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1225" id="v_1225" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1225">v_1225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1225
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde erbarmte in alſo ſere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1226" id="v_1226" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1226">v_1226
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1226
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ſie nimmere mere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1227" id="v_1227" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1227">v_1227
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1227
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Lebendic ſcholde ſehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1228" id="v_1228" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1228">v_1228
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1228
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er begonde ſvchen vn̄ ſpehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1229" id="v_1229" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1229">v_1229
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1229
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   biz daz er bi im vant
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1230" id="v_1230" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1230">v_1230
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1230
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ein hol gen dvrch die want.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1231" id="v_1231" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1231">v_1231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1231
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ſach er ſie an den ſtvnden
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1232" id="v_1232" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1232">v_1232
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1232
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nacket vnde gebvnden.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1233" id="v_1233" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1233">v_1233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1233
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1234" id="v_1234" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1234">v_1234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1234
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1235" id="v_1235" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1235">v_1235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1235
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1236" id="v_1236" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1236">v_1236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1236
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1237" id="v_1237" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1237">v_1237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1237
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1238" id="v_1238" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1238">v_1238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1238
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1239" id="v_1239" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1239">v_1239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1239
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1240" id="v_1240" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1240">v_1240
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1240
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1241" id="v_1241" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1241">v_1241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1241
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do er ſie ſo ſchone an ſach,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1242" id="v_1242" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1242">v_1242
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1242
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wider ſich ſelben er do ſprach:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1243" id="v_1243" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1243">v_1243
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1243
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›dv haſt einen alweren gedank,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1244" id="v_1244" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1244">v_1244
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1244
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   din ſin iſt leider worden kranc,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1245" id="v_1245" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1245">v_1245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1245
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1246" id="v_1246" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1246">v_1246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1246
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1247" id="v_1247" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1247">v_1247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1247
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1248" id="v_1248" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1248">v_1248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1248
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1249" id="v_1249" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1249">v_1249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1249
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz dv ditz ſmehelich leben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1250" id="v_1250" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1250">v_1250
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1250
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz dir got hat gegeben,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1251" id="v_1251" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1251">v_1251
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1251
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nicht gedvltiklichen treiſt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1252" id="v_1252" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1252">v_1252
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1252
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd dv doch niht reht enweiſt,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1253" id="v_1253" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1253">v_1253
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1253
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ob dich des kindes tot ernert.
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1254" id="v_1254" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1254">v_1254
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1254
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swaz dir got hat beſchert,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1255" id="v_1255" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1255">v_1255
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1255
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz laz alles geſchehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1256" id="v_1256" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1256">v_1256
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1256
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dvnen macht ires todes niht geſehē.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1257" id="v_1257" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1257">v_1257
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1257
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>Je rede liez er alzehant,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1258" id="v_1258" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1258">v_1258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1258
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er begonde kloppfen an die wāt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1259" id="v_1259" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1259">v_1259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1259
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ hiez ſich lazen dar in.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1260" id="v_1260" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1260">v_1260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1260
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſprach der meiſter: ›ichn pin
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1261" id="v_1261" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1261">v_1261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1261
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv niht mvzzic dar zv,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1262" id="v_1262" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1262">v_1262
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1262
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich vch icht vf tv.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1263" id="v_1263" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1263">v_1263
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1263
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1264" id="v_1264" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1264">v_1264
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1264
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1265" id="v_1265" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1265">v_1265
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1265
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   beitet, biz daz ditz erge.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1266" id="v_1266" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1266">v_1266
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1266
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Neina, meiſter, beſprechet mich e|.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1267" id="v_1267" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1267">v_1267
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1267
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1268" id="v_1268" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1268">v_1268
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1268
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1269" id="v_1269" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1269">v_1269
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1269
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er gienc vn̄ liez in in.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1270" id="v_1270" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1270">v_1270
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1270
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do gienc der arme heinrich hin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1271" id="v_1271" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1271">v_1271
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1271
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er ſie gebvnden ſach.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1272" id="v_1272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1272">v_1272
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1272
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wider den meiſter er do ſprach:
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1277" id="v_1277" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1277">v_1277
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1277
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Jr ſchvlt ſie wider vf lan.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1278" id="v_1278" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1278">v_1278
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1278
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz gvt, als ich gedinget han,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1279" id="v_1279" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1279">v_1279
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1279
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz wil ich vch vil gerne geben.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280" id="v_1280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280">v_1280
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr ſvlt die mait lazen leben!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1273" id="v_1273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1273">v_1273
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1273
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr lip, der iſt ſo minnenklich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1274" id="v_1274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1274">v_1274
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1274
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   weiz got, nv enmag ich
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1275" id="v_1275" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1275">v_1275
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1275
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jres todes niht geſehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1276" id="v_1276" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1276">v_1276
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1276
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gotes wille mvͦz geſchehen!‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280a" id="v_1280a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280a">v_1280a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der ſprach: ›herre, wolt ir d ͛ trewe pflegē,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280b" id="v_1280b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280b">v_1280b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir vch d ͛ meide wollet erwegen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280c" id="v_1280c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280c">v_1280c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Lieber herre, daz tvt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280d" id="v_1280d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280d">v_1280d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr wille, der iſt gar gvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280e" id="v_1280e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280e">v_1280e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jvch zv bvͤzzen iwer not;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280f" id="v_1280f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280f">v_1280f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar vmbe mvͤſte ſie ligen tot.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280g" id="v_1280g" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280g">v_1280g
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280g
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>er arme heinrich do ſprach:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280h" id="v_1280h" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280h">v_1280h
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280h
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›e| <span class="del">wold</span> ich ditz vngemach
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280i" id="v_1280i" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280i">v_1280i
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280i
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dvlden me wan tvſent iar.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280j" id="v_1280j" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280j">v_1280j
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280j
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch gewer vch, meiſter, fvrwar,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280k" id="v_1280k" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280k">v_1280k
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280k
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir mir niht wizet wan gvt.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280l" id="v_1280l" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280l">v_1280l
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280l
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er gewan einen vrolichen mvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280m" id="v_1280m" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280m">v_1280m
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280m
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er die mait ſolde lazen leben.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280n" id="v_1280n" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280n">v_1280n
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280n
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Svſt wart der lip ir gegeben,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280o" id="v_1280o" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280o">v_1280o
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280o
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie des todes niht enleit.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1280p" id="v_1280p" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280p">v_1280p
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280p
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1280q" id="v_1280q" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280q">v_1280q
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280q
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1280r" id="v_1280r" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280r">v_1280r
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280r
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280s" id="v_1280s" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280s">v_1280s
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280s
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die bant der meiſter vf ſneit
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280t" id="v_1280t" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280t">v_1280t
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280t
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde reichte ir die kleider.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1280u" id="v_1280u" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1280u">v_1280u
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1280u
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do geſchach nie kinde leider.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1281" id="v_1281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1281">v_1281
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1281
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>O die mait do geſach,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1282" id="v_1282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1282">v_1282
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1282
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ir daz ſterben niht geſchach,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1283" id="v_1283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1283">v_1283
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1283
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do was ſie beſweret mite.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1284" id="v_1284" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1284">v_1284
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1284
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie brach ire zvcht vnd ire ſite,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1284a" id="v_1284a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1284a">v_1284a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1284a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zv der brvſt ſie ſich ſlvc,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1284b" id="v_1284b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1284b">v_1284b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1284b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie hatte leide genvc,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1285" id="v_1285" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1285">v_1285
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1285
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie rovfte vn̄ kratzte ſich,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1286" id="v_1286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1286">v_1286
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1286
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr geberde was ſo iemerlich,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1287" id="v_1287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1287">v_1287
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1287
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz is nieman hette geſehen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1288" id="v_1288" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1288">v_1288
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1288
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jm were ze weinen geſchehen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1289" id="v_1289" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1289">v_1289
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1289
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vil lvte ſie ſchrey:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1290" id="v_1290" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1290">v_1290
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1290
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›owe mir vn̄ owẏ,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1291" id="v_1291" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1291">v_1291
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1291
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich ie wart geborn!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1292" id="v_1292" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1292">v_1292
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1292
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv han ich alrerſt verlorn
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1293" id="v_1293" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1293">v_1293
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1293
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die riche himel krone,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1294" id="v_1294" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1294">v_1294
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1294
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die were mir ze lone
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1295" id="v_1295" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1295">v_1295
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1295
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hevte gegeben vmbe die not.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1296" id="v_1296" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1296">v_1296
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1296
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv alrerſt bin ich tot!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1297" id="v_1297" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1297">v_1297
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1297
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Owe genediclicher criſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1298" id="v_1298" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1298">v_1298
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1298
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz eren vns benvmen iſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1299" id="v_1299" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1299">v_1299
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1299
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Minem herren vnde mir!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1300" id="v_1300" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1300">v_1300
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1300
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv enpirt er vnd ich enpir
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1301" id="v_1301" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1301">v_1301
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1301
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der eren, der vns was gedacht,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1302" id="v_1302" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1302">v_1302
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1302
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ob ditz were volbracht,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1303" id="v_1303" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1303">v_1303
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1303
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So were im der lip geneſen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1304" id="v_1304" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1304">v_1304
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1304
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd ich mvſt immer heilic weſen.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1305" id="v_1305" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1305">v_1305
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1305
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>W</span>Je vil ſie bete vmb iren tot,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1306" id="v_1306" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1306">v_1306
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1306
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr was dar zv vil not,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1307" id="v_1307" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1307">v_1307
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1307
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do nieman nach irem willen tete,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1308" id="v_1308" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1308">v_1308
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1308
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   weder dvrch drov noch dvrch bete.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1309" id="v_1309" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1309">v_1309
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1309
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do hvp ſich ein ſchelden.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1310" id="v_1310" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1310">v_1310
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1310
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie ſprach: ›ich mvz engelden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1311" id="v_1311" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1311">v_1311
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1311
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mines herren zageheit.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1312" id="v_1312" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1312">v_1312
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1312
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mir han die levte war geſeit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1313" id="v_1313" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1313">v_1313
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1313
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ovch han ich is ſelber wol geſehen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1314" id="v_1314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1314">v_1314
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1314
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch horte ie die levte iehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1315" id="v_1315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1315">v_1315
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1315
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Min herre were biderbe vn̄ gvt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1316" id="v_1316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1316">v_1316
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1316
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde trvge veſtes mannes mvt.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1317" id="v_1317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1317">v_1317
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1317
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz weiz got wol, ſie hant gelogen!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1318" id="v_1318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1318">v_1318
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1318
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die werlt was ie mit im betrogē.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1319" id="v_1319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1319">v_1319
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1319
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er was alle ſine tage
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1320" id="v_1320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1320">v_1320
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1320
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd iſt noch hivt ein werlt zage,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1321" id="v_1321" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1321">v_1321
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1321
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322" id="v_1322" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322">v_1322
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322a" id="v_1322a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322a">v_1322a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322b" id="v_1322b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322b">v_1322b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322c" id="v_1322c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322c">v_1322c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322d" id="v_1322d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322d">v_1322d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322e" id="v_1322e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322e">v_1322e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322m" id="v_1322m" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322m">v_1322m
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322m
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322n" id="v_1322n" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322n">v_1322n
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322n
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322o" id="v_1322o" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322o">v_1322o
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322o
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1322p" id="v_1322p" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322p">v_1322p
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322p
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1322q" id="v_1322q" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322q">v_1322q
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322q
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz im eines kindes tot
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1322r" id="v_1322r" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322r">v_1322r
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322r
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   hvlfe vz aller ſlahte not,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1322s" id="v_1322s" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322s">v_1322s
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322s
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz im ane ſvnde were
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1322t" id="v_1322t" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1322t">v_1322t
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1322t
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ane laſter bere,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1323" id="v_1323" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1323">v_1323
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1323
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des entravt er niht verdvlden.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1324" id="v_1324" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1324">v_1324
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1324
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Se, herre, von welchen ſchvlden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1325" id="v_1325" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1325">v_1325
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1325
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ſchracht ir, do man mich bant?
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1326" id="v_1326" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1326">v_1326
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1326
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv was doch ein veſte want
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1327" id="v_1327" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1327">v_1327
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1327
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Zwiſchen vch vnde mir.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1328" id="v_1328" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1328">v_1328
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1328
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz weizgot, nv entvrret ir
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1329" id="v_1329" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1329">v_1329
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1329
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Einen vremden tot niht geſehen!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1330" id="v_1330" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1330">v_1330
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1330
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil vch getrevlichen iehen,
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1331" id="v_1331" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1331">v_1331
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1331
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz vch nieman niht entvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332" id="v_1332" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332">v_1332
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn ſi vch nutze vnde gvt;
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332a" id="v_1332a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332a">v_1332a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ob ir iz dvrch iwer treͮwe lat,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332b" id="v_1332b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332b">v_1332b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz iſt ein alſo ſwacher rat,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332c" id="v_1332c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332c">v_1332c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des vch got niht danken wil.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332d" id="v_1332d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332d">v_1332d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der treͮwen, der iſt gar ze vil
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332e" id="v_1332e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332e">v_1332e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vn̄ mines herzen ſere.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332f" id="v_1332f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332f">v_1332f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jrn dvrfet nimmer mere
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332g" id="v_1332g" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332g">v_1332g
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332g
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mir noch anders nieman clagen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332h" id="v_1332h" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332h">v_1332h
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332h
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jch wil iz vch werlichen ſagen:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332i" id="v_1332i" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332i">v_1332i
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332i
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ver ſprechet ir daz artzebvch,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332j" id="v_1332j" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332j">v_1332j
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332j
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz weizgot wol, ich enrvch,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332k" id="v_1332k" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332k">v_1332k
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332k
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie lange vch got den lip qvelt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1332l" id="v_1332l" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1332l">v_1332l
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1332l
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv ir mir niht volgen welt.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1333" id="v_1333" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1333">v_1333
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1333
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1334" id="v_1334" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1334">v_1334
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1334
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1335" id="v_1335" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1335">v_1335
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1335
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1336" id="v_1336" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1336">v_1336
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1336
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1337" id="v_1337" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1337">v_1337
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1337
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>S</span>waz ſie ſcheltenſ begienc,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1338" id="v_1338" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1338">v_1338
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1338
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der arme heinrich iz enpfienc
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1340" id="v_1340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1340">v_1340
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1340
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gedvlticlichen vnde wol,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1339" id="v_1339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1339">v_1339
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1339
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als ein hvbſch ritter ſol,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1341" id="v_1341" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1341">v_1341
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1341
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dem gantzer tvgende nie gebraſt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1342" id="v_1342" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1342">v_1342
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1342
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do der genadeloſer gaſt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1344" id="v_1344" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1344">v_1344
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1344
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sinen artzet hat bereit
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1343" id="v_1343" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1343">v_1343
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1343
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ſine Jvncvrowen gekleit,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1345" id="v_1345" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1345">v_1345
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1345
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1346" id="v_1346" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1346">v_1346
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1346
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1347" id="v_1347" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1347">v_1347
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1347
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do vur er heim zelande.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1348" id="v_1348" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1348">v_1348
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1348
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſwie daz er erkande,
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1349" id="v_1349" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1349">v_1349
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1349
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er da heime fvnde,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1350" id="v_1350" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1350">v_1350
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1350
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit einem gemeinem mvnde
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1351" id="v_1351" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1351">v_1351
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1351
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nicht wan laſter vnde ſpot,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1352" id="v_1352" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1352">v_1352
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1352
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz liez er alles hin zegot.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1353" id="v_1353" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1353">v_1353
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1353
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do hatte ſich ovch die ſchone mait
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1354" id="v_1354" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1354">v_1354
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1354
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gar ver weinet vnd verklait
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1355" id="v_1355" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1355">v_1355
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1355
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sere biz vf des libes tot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1356" id="v_1356" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1356">v_1356
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1356
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do erkant ir treͮwe vnd ir not
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1357" id="v_1357" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1357">v_1357
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1357
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Cordis pectatorspectator,<span class="editorial_note">Die übliche Lesung dieses Wortes als  peccator scheint uns nicht richtig; wir lesen in beiden Handschriften pectator und schließen auf ein ausgelassenes s am Wortanfang</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1358" id="v_1358" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1358">v_1358
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1358
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do deheines herzen tor
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1359" id="v_1359" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1359">v_1359
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1359
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nimmer vor beſlozzen iſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1360" id="v_1360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1360">v_1360
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1360
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der dvrch ſine ſvͤze liſt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1361" id="v_1361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1361">v_1361
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1361
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an ir des gervchte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1362" id="v_1362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1362">v_1362
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1362
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz er ſie verſvchte
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1363" id="v_1363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1363">v_1363
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1363
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo rechte volliclichen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1364" id="v_1364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1364">v_1364
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1364
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   alſo ovch Job, den richen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1364a" id="v_1364a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1364a">v_1364a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1364a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1364b" id="v_1364b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1364b">v_1364b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1364b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1364c" id="v_1364c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1364c">v_1364c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1364c
