   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1364e" id="v_1364e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1364e">v_1364e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1364e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1364f" id="v_1364f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1364f">v_1364f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1364f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1365" id="v_1365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1365">v_1365
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1365
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do gedacht vnſer herre criſt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1366" id="v_1366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1366">v_1366
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1366
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie liep im treͮwe iſt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1367" id="v_1367" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1367">v_1367
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1367
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde ſchiet ſie do beide
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1368" id="v_1368" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1368">v_1368
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1368
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von allem irem leide
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1369" id="v_1369" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1369">v_1369
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1369
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1370" id="v_1370" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1370">v_1370
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1370
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1371" id="v_1371" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1371">v_1371
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1371
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1372" id="v_1372" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1372">v_1372
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1372
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1373" id="v_1373" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1373">v_1373
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1373
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde machte den herren vf dem wege
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1374" id="v_1374" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1374">v_1374
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1374
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von vnſers herrengotes pflege
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1374a" id="v_1374a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1374a">v_1374a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1374a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an aller ſlahte zwifel
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1374b" id="v_1374b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1374b">v_1374b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1374b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   geſvnt an ſinem libe,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1375" id="v_1375" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1375">v_1375
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1375
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1376" id="v_1376" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1376">v_1376
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1376
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz er alſo wol genas,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1377" id="v_1377" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1377">v_1377
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1377
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als er vor zweintzic iaren was.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1377a" id="v_1377a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1377a">v_1377a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1377a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>D</span>O die zeichen waren geſchehen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1377b" id="v_1377b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1377b">v_1377b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1377b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als wir ditz bvch horen iehen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1377c" id="v_1377c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1377c">v_1377c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1377c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do die warheit ſtet geſchriben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1377d" id="v_1377d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1377d">v_1377d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1377d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn wart niht lenger verſwigen:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1378" id="v_1378" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1378">v_1378
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1378
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1379" id="v_1379" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1379">v_1379
