<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386a" id="v_1386a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386a">v_1386a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   JznJz wurden lantmere,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386b" id="v_1386b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386b">v_1386b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz geneſen were
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386c" id="v_1386c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386c">v_1386c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der gvte herre heinrich.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386d" id="v_1386d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386d">v_1386d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des vreͮweten alle die levte ſich,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386e" id="v_1386e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386e">v_1386e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz enneme denne etſwen der nit,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386f" id="v_1386f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386f">v_1386f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der ſider adames zit
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386g" id="v_1386g" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386g">v_1386g
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386g
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jn der werlde nie gelac
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1386h" id="v_1386h" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1386h">v_1386h
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1386h
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Noch geleit biz an den ſvnes tac.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1387" id="v_1387" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1387">v_1387
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1387
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   <span>S</span>Jne vrvͤnt, die beſten,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1388" id="v_1388" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1388">v_1388
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1388
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ſine kraft weſten,<span class="editorial_note">Möglicherweise hat der Schreiber in seiner Vorlage kvnſt gelesen, anstatt kvnft, und aus welchen Gründen auch immer daraus kraft gemacht</span>
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1389" id="v_1389" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1389">v_1389
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1389
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die riten vnde giengen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1390" id="v_1390" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1390">v_1390
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1390
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſie in enpfiengen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1391" id="v_1391" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1391">v_1391
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1391
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Gegen in wol dri tage.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1392" id="v_1392" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1392">v_1392
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1392
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie gelovbeten anders deheiner ſage,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1393" id="v_1393" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1393">v_1393
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1393
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wanne irre ſelbes ovgen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1394" id="v_1394" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1394">v_1394
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1394
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſie kvren die gotes tovgen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1395" id="v_1395" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1395">v_1395
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1395
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   an ſinem ſchonen libe.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1396" id="v_1396" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1396">v_1396
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1396
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dem maier vnd ſinem wibe,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1398" id="v_1398" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1398">v_1398
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1398
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Man enwolde ſie rechtes rovben,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1397" id="v_1397" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1397">v_1397
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1397
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   jr ſvlt irziz wol gelovben,<span class="editorial_note">Offenbar hat der Schreiber das Tilgungszeichen über dem r in seiner Vorlage nicht erkannt</span>
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1399" id="v_1399" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1399">v_1399
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1399
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie da heime niht beliben.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1400" id="v_1400" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1400">v_1400
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1400
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die vrevde iſt immer vngeſchriben,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1401" id="v_1401" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1401">v_1401
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1401
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die ſie beide hatten,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1402" id="v_1402" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1402">v_1402
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1402
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſie got hatte beraten,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1403" id="v_1403" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1403">v_1403
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1403
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1404" id="v_1404" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1404">v_1404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1404
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz geſvnt waren bede,<span class="editorial_note">Der Vers entspricht A 1410 (Gärtner 1409), wurde aber mit höchst forciertem Reimwort
      an diese Stelle gelegt</span>
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1405" id="v_1405" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1405">v_1405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1405
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr tochter vnd ir herre.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1406" id="v_1406" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1406">v_1406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1406
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1407" id="v_1407" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1407">v_1407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1407
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1408" id="v_1408" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1408">v_1408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1408
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1409" id="v_1409" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1409">v_1409
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1409
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1410" id="v_1410" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1410">v_1410
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1410
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1410a" id="v_1410a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1410a">v_1410a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1410a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ſie dar ſcholden gahen,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1410b" id="v_1410b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1410b">v_1410b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1410b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſie ſie mvſten enphahen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1411" id="v_1411" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1411">v_1411
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1411
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der grvͦz was vnder ſniten
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1412" id="v_1412" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1412">v_1412
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1412
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   mit ſeltſenen ſiten:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1413" id="v_1413" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1413">v_1413
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1413
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit drivalder vrevde groz,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1414" id="v_1414" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1414">v_1414
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1414
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz daz lachen begoz
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1415" id="v_1415" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1415">v_1415
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1415
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der regen von den ovgen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1416" id="v_1416" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1416">v_1416
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1416
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz iſt ane lovgen.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1416a" id="v_1416a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1416a">v_1416a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1416a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1416b" id="v_1416b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1416b">v_1416b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1416b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1416c" id="v_1416c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1416c">v_1416c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1416c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1416d" id="v_1416d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1416d">v_1416d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1416d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1417" id="v_1417" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1417">v_1417
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1417
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie kvſten irre tohter mvnt
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1418" id="v_1418" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1418">v_1418
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1418
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   michels mer wan driſtvnt.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1419" id="v_1419" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1419">v_1419
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1419
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ovch enpfiengen in die ſwaben
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1420" id="v_1420" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1420">v_1420
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1420
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mit herlicher gaben.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1421" id="v_1421" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1421">v_1421
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1421
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz was ein williclicher grvz,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1422" id="v_1422" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1422">v_1422
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1422
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ein ietſlich man des iehen mvz,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1423" id="v_1423" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1423">v_1423
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1423
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1424" id="v_1424" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1424">v_1424
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1424
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1425" id="v_1425" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1425">v_1425
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1425
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz grozer vrevde nie wart.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1426" id="v_1426" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1426">v_1426
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1426
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Swie es an irem heimvart
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1428" id="v_1428" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1428">v_1428
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1428
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Fvrbaz ergienge
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1427" id="v_1427" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1427">v_1427
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1427
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   oder wie ſie in enpfiengeenpfiengen,<span class="editorial_note">Zu den reimbedingten endungslosen Infinitva vgl. V. 8, 110, 643, 686</span>
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1429" id="v_1429" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1429">v_1429
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1429
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   waz mag ich da von geſprechen me?
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1430" id="v_1430" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1430">v_1430
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1430
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er wart richer vil dan e|
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1431" id="v_1431" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1431">v_1431
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1431
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Des gvtes vnd der eren.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1432" id="v_1432" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1432">v_1432
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1432
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz begonde er alles keren
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1433" id="v_1433" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1433">v_1433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1433
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   williclichen hin ze got
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1434" id="v_1434" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1434">v_1434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1434
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnde leiſte gerne me ſin gebot,
   <br></span>





<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1435" id="v_1435" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1435">v_1435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1435
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   baz danne er e| tete.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1436" id="v_1436" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1436">v_1436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1436
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des beliben ſie in irre ſtete,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1437" id="v_1437" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1437">v_1437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1437
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Der mayer vnd die maierin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1438" id="v_1438" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1438">v_1438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1438
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die hatten wol vmb in
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1439" id="v_1439" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1439">v_1439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1439
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ver dienet ere vnde gvt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1440" id="v_1440" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1440">v_1440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1440
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er hatte nie ſo ſwachen mvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1441" id="v_1441" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1441">v_1441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1441
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jzn were rechte wol bewart:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1442" id="v_1442" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1442">v_1442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1442
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zv eigen gabe er in alzehant
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1444" id="v_1444" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1444">v_1444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1444
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die erde vnde die levte,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1443" id="v_1443" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1443">v_1443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1443
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz breite gereute,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1445" id="v_1445" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1445">v_1445
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1445
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do er ſiecher vfe lac.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1446" id="v_1446" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1446">v_1446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1446
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Siner genaden er do pflac
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1447" id="v_1447" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1447">v_1447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1447
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1448" id="v_1448" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1448">v_1448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1448
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1449" id="v_1449" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1449">v_1449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1449
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Als einer vrowen vnde baz;
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1450" id="v_1450" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1450">v_1450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1450
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz recht gebot im daz,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1450a" id="v_1450a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1450a">v_1450a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1450a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Ovch ſin tvgenthafter mvt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1450b" id="v_1450b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1450b">v_1450b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1450b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er was getreͮwe vnde gvt.
   <br></span>





<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1451" id="v_1451" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1451">v_1451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1451
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do begonden im die wiſen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1452" id="v_1452" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1452">v_1452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1452
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Raten vnde priſen
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1453" id="v_1453" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1453">v_1453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1453
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vmbe eliche vriat.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1454" id="v_1454" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1454">v_1454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1454
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vngeſament was der rat.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1455" id="v_1455" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1455">v_1455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1455
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er ſait in allen ſinen mvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1456" id="v_1456" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1456">v_1456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1456
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er ſprach, dvncket iz ſie gvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1457" id="v_1457" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1457">v_1457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1457
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er wolde ſich beſenden
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1458" id="v_1458" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1458">v_1458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1458
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd die rede vol enden.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1459" id="v_1459" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1459">v_1459
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1459
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1460" id="v_1460" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1460">v_1460
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1460
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1461" id="v_1461" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1461">v_1461
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1461
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1462" id="v_1462" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1462">v_1462
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1462
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1463" id="v_1463" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1463">v_1463
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1463
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie ſchire er da gewan
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1464" id="v_1464" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1464">v_1464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1464
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vrevnt, mage, dienſtman,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1465" id="v_1465" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1465">v_1465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1465
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd tet iz in allentſamt kvnt.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1466" id="v_1466" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1466">v_1466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1466
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſprach ein gemeiner mvnt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1467" id="v_1467" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1467">v_1467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1467
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jz were gvt vnde zit.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1468" id="v_1468" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1468">v_1468
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1468
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do hvb ſich ein michel ſtrit
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1469" id="v_1469" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1469">v_1469
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1469
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zwiſſchen dem rate vnder in:
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1470" id="v_1470" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1470">v_1470
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1470
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   der eine reit her, · der ander hin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1471" id="v_1471" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1471">v_1471
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1471
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   als die levte taten,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1472" id="v_1472" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1472">v_1472
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1472
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do man ſolde raten.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1472a" id="v_1472a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1472a">v_1472a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1472a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1472b" id="v_1472b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1472b">v_1472b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1472b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1473" id="v_1473" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1473">v_1473
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1473
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jr rat, der was <span class="del">wiſlich</span><span class="del">miſlich</span>.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1474" id="v_1474" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1474">v_1474
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1474
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſprach der herre heinrich:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1475" id="v_1475" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1475">v_1475
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1475
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Nv iſt vch allen wol kvnt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1476" id="v_1476" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1476">v_1476
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1476
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz ich was in kvrtzer ſtvnt
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1477" id="v_1477" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1477">v_1477
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1477
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   harte vngeneme
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1478" id="v_1478" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1478">v_1478
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1478
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd der werlde wider zeme.
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1480" id="v_1480" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1480">v_1480
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1480
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv han ich einen geſvnden lip,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1479" id="v_1479" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1479">v_1479
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1479
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv ſcheͮwet mich weder man noch wip,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1481" id="v_1481" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1481">v_1481
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1481
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von vnſers herren gebot.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1482" id="v_1482" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1482">v_1482
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1482
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv ratet mir alle dvrch got,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1483" id="v_1483" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1483">v_1483
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1483
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   von dem ich die genade han,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1484" id="v_1484" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1484">v_1484
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1484
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die got zv mir hat getan,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1485" id="v_1485" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1485">v_1485
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1485
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1486" id="v_1486" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1486">v_1486
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1486
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie ich iz verſchvlde wider in.‹
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1487" id="v_1487" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1487">v_1487
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1487
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sie ſprachen: ›nemet vͤch einen ſin,
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1488" id="v_1488" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1488">v_1488
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1488
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz vch lip vnde gvt,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1488a" id="v_1488a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1488a">v_1488a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1488a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dar zv iwer ſteter mvt,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1489" id="v_1489" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1489">v_1489
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1489
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Jmmer vnder tan ſi.‹
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1490" id="v_1490" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1490">v_1490
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1490
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Sin gemale ſtvnt da bi,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1491" id="v_1491" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1491">v_1491
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1491
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die er vil lieplich an ſach.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1492" id="v_1492" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1492">v_1492
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1492
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er vmbe vienc ſie vnde ſprach:
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1493" id="v_1493" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1493">v_1493
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1493
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ›Nv iſt vch allen wol geſait,
   <br></span>

<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1494" id="v_1494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1494">v_1494
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1494
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich von dirre ſchonen mait
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1495" id="v_1495" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1495">v_1495
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1495
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Minen lip geſvnden han,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1496" id="v_1496" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1496">v_1496
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1496
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   die ir vor vch hie ſehet ſtan.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1497" id="v_1497" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1497">v_1497
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1497
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv iſt ſie vri als ich da bin.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1498" id="v_1498" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1498">v_1498
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1498
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nv retet mir aller min ſin,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1499" id="v_1499" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1499">v_1499
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1499
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ich ſie zv einer vrowen neme.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1500" id="v_1500" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1500">v_1500
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1500
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   got gebe, daz iz vch wol gezeme.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1501" id="v_1501" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1501">v_1501
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1501
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1502" id="v_1502" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1502">v_1502
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1502
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Mag aber des niht ergan,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1502a" id="v_1502a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1502a">v_1502a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1502a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ſo ſchvlt ir merken ſvnder wan,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1503" id="v_1503" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1503">v_1503
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1503
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So wil ich bliben ane wip,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1504" id="v_1504" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1504">v_1504
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1504
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wan ich han ere vn̄ lip
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1505" id="v_1505" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1505">v_1505
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1505
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nicht wan von iren ſchvlden.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1506" id="v_1506" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1506">v_1506
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1506
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   dvrch vnſers herren hvlden
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1507" id="v_1507" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1507">v_1507
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1507
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   So bit ich vch alle,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1508" id="v_1508" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1508">v_1508
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1508
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz iz vch wol gevalle.‹
   <br></span>



<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1509" id="v_1509" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1509">v_1509
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1509
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1510" id="v_1510" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1510">v_1510
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1510
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1511" id="v_1511" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1511">v_1511
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1511
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz davchte ſie ein fvͤge.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1512" id="v_1512" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1512">v_1512
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1512
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do was pfaffen genvge,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513" id="v_1513" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513">v_1513
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Die gaben ſie im zv einer elichen<span class="lb">|</span>koͤne.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v_1514" id="v_1514" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1514">v_1514
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1514
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513a" id="v_1513a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513a">v_1513a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nach werltlicher woͤne
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513b" id="v_1513b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513b">v_1513b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wolden ſie beide niht.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513c" id="v_1513c" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513c">v_1513c
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513c
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   zweier engel zv verſicht
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513d" id="v_1513d" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513d">v_1513d
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513d
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Schein an in beiden,
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513e" id="v_1513e" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513e">v_1513e
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513e
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   do ſie ſich mvſten ſcheiden.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513f" id="v_1513f" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513f">v_1513f
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513f
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Er hette ſie wol beſlafen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513g" id="v_1513g" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513g">v_1513g
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513g
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   nach werltlichem ſchafen;
   <br></span>




<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513h" id="v_1513h" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513h">v_1513h
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513h
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vor gote er ſichez getroſtergetroſte,<span class="editorial_note">Die (beinahe parodistisch klingende) reimbedingte Endung auf -r ist grammatisch nicht
      haltbar</span>
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513i" id="v_1513i" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513i">v_1513i
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513i
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   er tet ſich in ein kleiſterkloſter
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513j" id="v_1513j" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513j">v_1513j
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513j
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   vnd bevalch ſich der vrien
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513k" id="v_1513k" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513k">v_1513k
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513k
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   gotes mvter ſente marien –
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513l" id="v_1513l" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513l">v_1513l
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513l
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Da bi in einem tvme.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1513m" id="v_1513m" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1513m">v_1513m
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1513m
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   wie moht er immer baz getvn!
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1515" id="v_1515" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1515">v_1515
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1515
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Do ver dienten ſie beide geliche
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1516" id="v_1516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1516">v_1516
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1516
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   daz vrone himelriche.
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1517" id="v_1517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1517">v_1517
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1517
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz lon mvz vns allen
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1518" id="v_1518" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1518">v_1518
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1518
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   ze Jvngeſt gevallen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1519" id="v_1519" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1519">v_1519
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1519
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Daz ſie da genamen.
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1520" id="v_1520" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1520">v_1520
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1520
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   des helfe vns got, amen,
   <br></span>


<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1520a" id="v_1520a" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1520a">v_1520a
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1520a
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Dvrch ſiner marter ere!
   <br></span>
<span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v_1520b" id="v_1520b" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./Bb.html#v_1520b">v_1520b
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </a></span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v_1520b
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      </span>
   Nv en iſt der rede niht mere.
   <br></span>


